<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MRK" style="id">- Biblica® Open Kikuyu Holy Word of God</book>
  <para style="h">Mariko</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mariko</para>
  <para style="toc2">Mariko</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mar</para>
  <para style="mt1">MARIKO</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MRK 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Johana Mũbatithania Kũhaarĩria Njĩra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 1:1"/>Kĩambĩrĩria kĩa Ũhoro-ũrĩa-Mwega ũkoniĩ Jesũ Kristũ Mũrũ wa Ngai.<verse eid="MRK 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 1:2"/>O ta ũrĩa kwandĩkĩtwo ibuku-inĩ rĩa Isaia ũrĩa mũnabii atĩrĩ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:2">“Nĩngũtũma mũtũmwo wakwa athiĩ mbere yaku,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 1:2">ũrĩa ũgũgũthondekera njĩra yaku.”<verse eid="MRK 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 1:3"/>“Kũrĩ mũgambo wa mũndũ ũkwanĩrĩra werũ-inĩ akoiga atĩrĩ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:3">‘Haarĩriai njĩra ya Mwathani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 1:3">rũngariai njĩra ciake.’ ”<verse eid="MRK 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 1:4"/>Nĩ ũndũ ũcio Johana ookire akĩhunjagia, na akĩbatithanagĩria werũ-inĩ. Aahunjagia atĩ andũ merire, nĩguo marekerwo mehia mao, nĩgeetha mabatithio. <verse eid="MRK 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 1:5"/>Nao andũ othe a bũrũri wa Judea na andũ othe a Jerusalemu magĩthiĩ kũrĩ we. Moimbũraga mehia mao, nake akamabatithĩria rũũĩ-inĩ rwa Jorodani. <verse eid="MRK 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 1:6"/>Johana ehumbaga nguo ciathondeketwo na guoya wa ngamĩĩra, na nĩehotoraga mũcibi wa rũũa njohero, na aarĩĩaga ngigĩ na ũũkĩ wa gĩthaka. <verse eid="MRK 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 1:7"/>Nayo ndũmĩrĩri yake yarĩ ĩno: “Thuutha wakwa nĩgũgũũka mũndũ ũngĩ ũrĩ na hinya kũngĩra, ũrĩa niĩ itagĩrĩire kũinamĩrĩra njohore ndigi cia iraatũ ciake. <verse eid="MRK 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 1:8"/>Niĩ ndĩmũbatithagia na maaĩ, nowe arĩmũbatithagia na Roho Mũtheru.”<verse eid="MRK 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kũbatithio na Kũgerio kwa Jesũ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 1:9"/>Na rĩrĩ, ihinda o rĩu Jesũ agĩũka oimĩte Nazarethi kũu Galili, na akĩbatithio nĩ Johana rũũĩ-inĩ rwa Jorodani. <verse eid="MRK 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 1:10"/>Na rĩrĩa Jesũ oimĩraga maaĩ-inĩ akĩona igũrũ rĩahingũka, nake Roho Mũtheru akĩmũikũrũkĩra ahaana ta ndutura. <verse eid="MRK 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 1:11"/>Mũgambo ũkiuma igũrũ ũkiuga atĩrĩ, “We nĩwe Mũrũ wakwa ũrĩa nyendete, na nĩngenaga mũno nĩwe.”<verse eid="MRK 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 1:12"/>Na o rĩmwe Roho akĩmuoya akĩmũtwara werũ-inĩ, <verse eid="MRK 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 1:13"/>na agĩikara kũu werũ-inĩ matukũ mĩrongo ĩna, akĩgeragio nĩ Shaitani. Nake aikaranagia na nyamũ cia gĩthaka, nao araika makamũtungatagĩra.<verse eid="MRK 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jesũ gwĩta Arutwo ake a Mbere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 1:14"/>Thuutha wa Johana gũikio njeera, Jesũ agĩthiĩ Galili akĩhunjagia Ũhoro-ũrĩa-Mwega wa Ngai, <verse eid="MRK 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 1:15"/>akiuga atĩrĩ, “Ihinda nĩikinyu, naguo ũthamaki wa Ngai nĩũkuhĩrĩirie. Mwĩrirei mwĩtĩkie Ũhoro-ũrĩa-Mwega!”<verse eid="MRK 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 1:16"/>Na rĩrĩa Jesũ aathiiagĩra hũgũrũrũ-inĩ cia iria rĩa Galili, nĩonire Simoni na mũrũ wa nyina Anderea magĩikia neti ciao iria-inĩ, nĩgũkorwo maarĩ ategi a thamaki. <verse eid="MRK 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 1:17"/>Nake Jesũ akĩmeera atĩrĩ, “Ũkai, mũnũmĩrĩre, na nĩngamũtua ategi a andũ.” <verse eid="MRK 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 1:18"/>O rĩmwe magĩtiganĩria neti ciao makĩmũrũmĩrĩra.<verse eid="MRK 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 1:19"/>Na aathiathia hanini, akĩona Jakubu mũrũ wa Zebedi hamwe na mũrũ wa nyina Johana marĩ gatarũ-inĩ makĩhaarĩria neti ciao. <verse eid="MRK 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 1:20"/>O rĩmwe akĩmeeta, nao magĩtiga ithe wao Zebedi gatarũ-inĩ hamwe na aruti ake a wĩra na makĩmũrũmĩrĩra.<verse eid="MRK 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jesũ Kũingata Ngoma Thũku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 1:21"/>Nao magĩthiĩ Kaperinaumu, na rĩrĩa mũthenya wa Thabatũ wakinyire, Jesũ agĩtoonya thunagogi na akĩambĩrĩria kũrutana. <verse eid="MRK 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 1:22"/>Na andũ makĩgegio nĩ ũrutani wake, nĩgũkorwo aamarutaga ta mũndũ warĩ na ũhoti, no ti ta arutani a watho. <verse eid="MRK 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 1:23"/>Na rĩrĩ, hĩndĩ o ĩyo kũu thunagogi yao, nĩ kwarĩ na mũndũ warĩ na ngoma thũku, nake akĩanĩrĩra, akiuga atĩrĩ, <verse eid="MRK 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 1:24"/>“Ũrenda atĩa na ithuĩ, wee Jesũ wa Nazarethi? Ũũkĩte gũtũniina? Nĩnjũũĩ wee nĩwe ũ! Wee nĩwe Ũrĩa-Mũtheru-wa-Ngai.”<verse eid="MRK 1:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 1:25"/>Nake Jesũ akĩmĩkũma na hinya, akiuga atĩrĩ, “Kira na uume thĩinĩ wake!” <verse eid="MRK 1:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 1:26"/>Ngoma ĩyo thũku ĩkĩmũthukathuka na hinya na ĩkiuma thĩinĩ wake ĩgĩkayaga.<verse eid="MRK 1:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 1:27"/>Andũ acio othe makĩgega mũno nginya makĩũrania atĩrĩ, “Ũndũ ũyũ nĩ ũrĩkũ? Ũyũ nĩ ũrutani mwerũ, wĩ na ũhoti! Nĩ araatha o na ngoma thũku na ikamwathĩkĩra.” <verse eid="MRK 1:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 1:28"/>Nayo ngumo yake ĩkĩhunja na ihenya bũrũri wothe wa Galili.<verse eid="MRK 1:28"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jesũ Kũhonia Andũ Aingĩ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 1:29"/>Na maarĩkia kuuma thunagogi, magĩthiĩ na Jakubu na Johana mũciĩ gwa Simoni na Anderea. <verse eid="MRK 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 1:30"/>Na rĩrĩ, nyina wa mũtumia wa Simoni aarĩ gĩtanda-inĩ arĩ mũrũaru mũrimũ wa kũhiũha mwĩrĩ, nao makĩĩra Jesũ ũhoro wake. <verse eid="MRK 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 1:31"/>Nĩ ũndũ ũcio Jesũ agĩthiĩ harĩa aarĩ, akĩmũnyiita guoko akĩmũũkĩria. Mũrimũ ũcio wa kũhiũha mwĩrĩ ũkĩmũtiga na akĩambĩrĩria kũmatungatĩra.<verse eid="MRK 1:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 1:32"/>Hwaĩ-inĩ ũcio thuutha wa riũa gũthũa, andũ makĩrehera Jesũ andũ arĩa othe maarĩ arũaru na arĩa maarĩ na ndaimono. <verse eid="MRK 1:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 1:33"/>Nao andũ a itũũra othe makĩũngana hau mũrango-inĩ wa nyũmba, <verse eid="MRK 1:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 1:34"/>nake Jesũ akĩhonia andũ aingĩ arĩa maarĩ na mĩrimũ mĩthemba mĩingĩ. Ningĩ akĩingata ndaimono nyingĩ, no ndetĩkĩririe ndaimono ciarie tondũ nĩciamũũĩ.<verse eid="MRK 1:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jesũ Kũhooya arĩ Handũ Keheri-inĩ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 1:35"/>Rũciinĩ kĩroko tene kũrĩ o na nduma, Jesũ agĩũkĩra akiuma nyũmba agĩthiĩ handũ keheri-inĩ, akĩhoera ho. <verse eid="MRK 1:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 1:36"/>Nake Simoni na arĩa maarĩ nao magĩthiĩ kũmwetha, <verse eid="MRK 1:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 1:37"/>na rĩrĩa maamuonire, makĩanĩrĩra, makĩmwĩra atĩrĩ: “Andũ othe nĩwe maracaria!”<verse eid="MRK 1:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 1:38"/>Jesũ akĩmacookeria atĩrĩ, “Rekei tuume gũkũ tũthiĩ kũndũ kũngĩ, matũũra-inĩ marĩa me hakuhĩ, nĩguo hunjie o nakuo. Tondũ nĩkĩo ndokire.” <verse eid="MRK 1:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 1:39"/>Nĩ ũndũ ũcio agĩthiũrũrũka Galili guothe akĩhunjagia thunagogi-inĩ ciao na akĩingataga ndaimono.<verse eid="MRK 1:39"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mũndũ warĩ na Mangũ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 1:40"/>Na mũndũ ũmwe warĩ na mangũ agĩũka kũrĩ we na akĩmũthaitha aturĩtie maru, akĩmwĩra atĩrĩ, “Ũngĩenda-rĩ, no ũũtherie.”<verse eid="MRK 1:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 1:41"/>Nake Jesũ akĩringwo nĩ tha nyingĩ, agĩtambũrũkia guoko gwake akĩhutia mũndũ ũcio. Akĩmwĩra atĩrĩ, “Nĩ ngwenda. Therio.” <verse eid="MRK 1:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 1:42"/>Na o hĩndĩ ĩyo mũndũ ũcio agĩthirwo nĩ mangũ, akĩhonio.<verse eid="MRK 1:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 1:43"/>Nake Jesũ akĩmũkaania na hinya na akĩmwĩra athiĩ, <verse eid="MRK 1:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 1:44"/>ningĩ akĩmwĩra atĩrĩ, “Menya ndũkeere mũndũ o na ũrĩkũ ũhoro ũyũ. No thiĩ ũkeyonanie kũrĩ mũthĩnjĩri-Ngai, na ũrute magongona marĩa Musa aathanĩte nĩ ũndũ wa gũtherio gwaku, ũtuĩke ũira kũrĩ o.” <verse eid="MRK 1:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 1:45"/>No handũ ha ũguo agĩthiĩ, akĩambĩrĩria kwaria na kũmemerekia ũhoro ũcio. Nĩ ũndũ ũcio Jesũ ndacookire kũhota gũtoonya itũũra thĩinĩ akĩonagwo nĩ andũ, no aikaraga na nja kũndũ gũtaarĩ andũ. No andũ no mookaga kũrĩ we moimĩte kũndũ guothe.<verse eid="MRK 1:45"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MRK 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Jesũ Kũhonia Mũndũ Wakuĩte Ciĩga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 2:1"/>Matukũ manini maathira, Jesũ agĩcooka Kaperinaumu rĩngĩ, nao andũ makĩigua atĩ nĩoka mũciĩ. <verse eid="MRK 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 2:2"/>Nĩ ũndũ ũcio andũ aingĩ makĩũngana nginya hakĩaga handũ ha gũikarwo, o na nginya nja ya mũrango, nake akĩmahunjĩria ũhoro. <verse eid="MRK 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 2:3"/>Nĩhookire andũ, makĩmũrehera mũndũ warũarĩte mũrimũ wa gũkua ciĩga, akuuĩtwo nĩ andũ ana. <verse eid="MRK 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 2:4"/>Na tondũ matingĩahotire kũmũkinyia harĩa Jesũ aarĩ nĩ ũndũ wa ũingĩ wa andũ-rĩ, magĩtharũria nyũmba igũrũ wa hau Jesũ aarĩ na maarĩkia kũhatharia, makĩharũrũkia mũndũ ũcio wakuĩte ciĩga arĩ kĩbarĩ-inĩ kĩu aakomeire. <verse eid="MRK 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 2:5"/>Rĩrĩa Jesũ oonire wĩtĩkio wao, akĩĩra mũndũ ũcio wakuĩte ciĩga atĩrĩ, “Mũriũ, nĩwarekerwo mehia maku.”<verse eid="MRK 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 2:6"/>Na rĩrĩ, arutani amwe a watho maarĩ ho, nao makĩĩyũria na ngoro atĩrĩ, <verse eid="MRK 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 2:7"/>“Mũndũ ũyũ ekwaria ũguo nĩkĩ? Nĩ araruma Ngai! Nũũ ũngĩ ũngĩhota kũrekanĩra mehia tiga Ngai wiki?”<verse eid="MRK 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 2:8"/>O rĩmwe Jesũ akĩmenya thĩinĩ wa roho wake atĩ ũguo nĩguo meciiragia ngoro-inĩ ciao, nake akĩmooria atĩrĩ, “Nĩ kĩĩ gĩgũtũma mwĩciirie maũndũ macio ngoro-inĩ cianyu? <verse eid="MRK 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 2:9"/>Nĩ ũndũ ũrĩkũ mũhũthũ: kwĩra mũndũ ũyũ ũkuĩte ciĩga atĩrĩ, ‘Nĩ warekerwo mehia maku,’ kana kũmwĩra atĩrĩ, ‘Ũkĩra woe kĩbarĩ gĩaku wĩtware’? <verse eid="MRK 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 2:10"/>No nĩgeetha mũmenye atĩ Mũrũ wa Mũndũ arĩ na ũhoti gũkũ thĩ wa kũrekanĩra mehia-rĩ … .” Akĩĩra mũndũ ũcio wakuĩte ciĩga atĩrĩ, <verse eid="MRK 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 2:11"/>“Ndakwĩra atĩrĩ, ũkĩra, oya kĩbarĩ gĩaku ũinũke mũciĩ.” <verse eid="MRK 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 2:12"/>Nake agĩũkĩra, akĩoya kĩbarĩ gĩake, agĩĩthiĩra andũ othe mamwĩroreire. Ũndũ ũcio ũgĩtũma andũ othe magege, nao makĩgooca Ngai, makiuga atĩrĩ, “Kaĩ tũtirĩ tuona ũndũ ta ũyũ-ĩ!”<verse eid="MRK 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Gwĩtwo kwa Lawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 2:13"/>O rĩngĩ Jesũ nĩoimagarire agĩthiĩ hũgũrũrũ-inĩ cia iria; nakĩo kĩrĩndĩ kĩnene gĩgĩũka kũrĩ we, nake akĩambĩrĩria gũkĩruta ũhoro. <verse eid="MRK 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 2:14"/>Na hĩndĩ ĩrĩa aahĩtũkaga, akĩona Lawi mũrũ wa Alufayo aikarĩte harĩa heetagĩrio mbeeca cia igooti. Jesũ akĩmwĩra atĩrĩ, “Nũmĩrĩra,” nake Lawi agĩũkĩra akĩmũrũmĩrĩra.<verse eid="MRK 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 2:15"/>Na rĩrĩa Jesũ aarĩĩaga irio cia hwaĩ-inĩ nyũmba kwa Lawi, etia mbeeca cia igooti aingĩ na ehia nĩmarĩĩanĩire nake na arutwo ake, tondũ maarĩ aingĩ nĩmamũrũmĩrĩire. <verse eid="MRK 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 2:16"/>Rĩrĩa arutani a watho arĩa maarĩ Afarisai moonire akĩrĩĩanĩra na andũ ehia na etia mbeeca cia igooti, makĩũria arutwo ake atĩrĩ, “Arĩĩanagĩra na etia mbeeca cia igooti na ehia nĩkĩ?”<verse eid="MRK 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 2:17"/>Nake Jesũ aigua ũguo akĩmeera atĩrĩ, “Andũ arĩa agima mĩĩrĩ ti o mabataragio nĩ ndagĩtarĩ, no nĩ arĩa arũaru. Ndiokire gwĩta andũ arĩa athingu, no nĩ arĩa ehia.”<verse eid="MRK 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jesũ Kũũrio Ũhoro wa Kwĩhinga kũrĩa Irio</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 2:18"/>Na rĩrĩ, arutwo a Johana na Afarisai nĩmehingĩte kũrĩa irio. Andũ amwe magĩũka makĩũria Jesũ atĩrĩ, “Nĩkĩ gĩtũmaga arutwo a Johana na arutwo a Afarisai mehinge kũrĩa irio, no arutwo aku matiĩhingaga?”<verse eid="MRK 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 2:19"/>Nake Jesũ akĩmacookeria atĩrĩ, “Ageni a mũhikania mangĩĩhinga kũrĩa irio atĩa rĩrĩa arĩ hamwe nao? Matingĩhinga rĩrĩa rĩothe marĩ hamwe nake. <verse eid="MRK 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 2:20"/>No ihinda nĩrĩgakinya rĩrĩa mũhikania akeeherio kuuma kũrĩ o, na hĩndĩ ĩyo nĩmakehinga kũrĩa irio.”<verse eid="MRK 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 2:21"/>“Gũtirĩ mũndũ wĩkagĩra nguo ngũrũ kĩraka kĩerũ. Angĩĩka ũguo, kĩraka kĩu kĩerũ no kĩguucie nguo ĩyo ngũrũ, nakĩo gĩtũme hau hatarũku hatũrĩke makĩria. <verse eid="MRK 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 2:22"/>Ningĩ gũtirĩ mũndũ wĩkĩraga ndibei ya mũhihano mondo-inĩ ngũrũ. Angĩĩka ũguo, ndibei ĩyo no ĩtarũre mondo icio, nayo ndibei ĩyo ĩitĩke, nacio mondo ithũke. No rĩrĩ, ndibei ya mũhihano ĩĩkĩragwo thĩinĩ wa mondo njerũ.”<verse eid="MRK 2:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mwathani wa Thabatũ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 2:23"/>Na mũthenya ũmwe warĩ wa Thabatũ-rĩ, Jesũ nĩatuĩkanĩirie mĩgũnda-inĩ ya ngano. Na rĩrĩa aathiiaga arĩ hamwe na arutwo ake, arutwo makĩambĩrĩria gũtua ngira cia ngano. <verse eid="MRK 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 2:24"/>Nao Afarisai makĩmwĩra atĩrĩ, “Ta rora, nĩ kĩĩ kĩratũma arutwo aku meke ũrĩa watho ũtetĩkĩrĩtie mũthenya wa Thabatũ?”<verse eid="MRK 2:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 2:25"/>Nake akĩmacookeria atĩrĩ, “Kaĩ mũtarĩ mwathoma ũrĩa Daudi we mwene na arĩa maarĩ nake meekire rĩrĩa maarĩ ahũtu na makabatario nĩ gĩa kũrĩa? <verse eid="MRK 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 2:26"/>Aatoonyire nyũmba ya Ngai rĩrĩa Abiatharu aarĩ mũthĩnjĩri-Ngai ũrĩa mũnene, akĩrĩa mĩgate ĩrĩa yamũrĩirwo Ngai, o ĩrĩa yetĩkĩrĩtio kũrĩĩagwo nĩ athĩnjĩri-Ngai oiki. Na agĩcooka akĩhe arĩa maarĩ nake ĩmwe yayo.”<verse eid="MRK 2:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 2:27"/>Ningĩ akĩmeera atĩrĩ, “Mũthenya wa Thabatũ wekĩrirwo ho nĩ ũndũ wa mũndũ, no mũndũ ndombirwo nĩ ũndũ wa Thabatũ. <verse eid="MRK 2:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 2:28"/>Nĩ ũndũ ũcio, Mũrũ wa Mũndũ nĩ Mwathani o na wa mũthenya wa Thabatũ.”<verse eid="MRK 2:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MRK 3"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 3:1"/>Ningĩ nĩatoonyire thunagogi rĩngĩ, na thĩinĩ nĩ kwarĩ na mũndũ wonjete guoko. <verse eid="MRK 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 3:2"/>Andũ amwe ao nĩmacaragia ũndũ mangĩthitangĩra Jesũ, nĩ ũndũ ũcio makĩmũrora mũno mone kana nĩekũhonia mũndũ ũcio mũthenya wa Thabatũ. <verse eid="MRK 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 3:3"/>Nake Jesũ akĩĩra mũndũ ũcio warĩ mwonju guoko atĩrĩ, “Rũgama haha mbere ya andũ othe.”<verse eid="MRK 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 3:4"/>Ningĩ Jesũ akĩmooria atĩrĩ, “Nĩ ũndũ ũrĩkũ mwĩtĩkĩrie nĩ watho mũthenya wa Thabatũ; nĩ gwĩka wega kana nĩ gwĩka ũũru, nĩ kũhonokia muoyo kana nĩ kũũraga?” No-o magĩkira ki.<verse eid="MRK 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 3:5"/>Akĩmarora arakaire, na aiguĩte ũũru nĩ ũndũ wa ũremi wa ngoro ciao, akĩĩra mũndũ ũcio atĩrĩ, “Tambũrũkia guoko gwaku.” Nake agĩgũtambũrũkia, nakuo guoko gũkĩhona biũ. <verse eid="MRK 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 3:6"/>Hĩndĩ ĩyo Afarisai makiumagara na makĩambĩrĩria gũthugunda me hamwe na Aherodia ũrĩa mangĩũraga Jesũ.<verse eid="MRK 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Gĩkundi Kĩnene Kũrũmĩrĩra Jesũ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 3:7"/>Nake Jesũ na arutwo ake makiuma kũu magĩthiĩ iria-inĩ, nakĩo gĩkundi kĩnene kĩa andũ kuuma Galili gĩkĩmũrũmĩrĩra. <verse eid="MRK 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 3:8"/>Na rĩrĩa maiguire ũrĩa wothe eekaga, andũ aingĩ magĩũka kũrĩ we moimĩte Judea, na Jerusalemu na Idumea o na mũrĩmo ũrĩa ũngĩ wa Jorodani, o na kuuma kũrĩa gwakuhĩrĩirie Turo na Sidoni. <verse eid="MRK 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 3:9"/>Na tondũ wa gĩkundi kĩu, akĩĩra arutwo ake mamũhaarĩrĩrie gatarũ nĩguo gĩkundi kĩu gĩtige kũmũhatĩka. <verse eid="MRK 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 3:10"/>Nĩgũkorwo nĩahonetie andũ aingĩ, nĩ ũndũ ũcio arĩa maarĩ na mĩrimũ nĩmatindĩkanaga nĩguo mamũhutie. <verse eid="MRK 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 3:11"/>Na rĩrĩa rĩothe ngoma thũku ciamuonaga, ciegũithagia thĩ mbere yake, igakaya ikiugaga atĩrĩ, “Wee nĩwe Mũrũ wa Ngai.” <verse eid="MRK 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 3:12"/>Nowe agĩcikaania na hinya mũno itikoige we nĩwe ũ.<verse eid="MRK 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jesũ Gũthuura Arutwo Ikũmi na Eerĩ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 3:13"/>Jesũ agĩcooka akĩambata kĩrĩma-inĩ na agĩĩta arĩa eyendeire, nao magĩũka harĩ we. <verse eid="MRK 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 3:14"/>Akĩamũra ikũmi na eerĩ, akĩmatua atũmwo, nĩgeetha makoragwo nake, na nĩguo amatũmage makahunjie, <verse eid="MRK 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 3:15"/>na magĩe na ũhoti wa kũingata ndaimono. <verse eid="MRK 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 3:16"/>Andũ acio ikũmi na eerĩ aathuurire nĩ Simoni (ũrĩa aatuire Petero); <verse eid="MRK 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 3:17"/>na Jakubu wa Zebedi na mũrũ wa nyina Johana (nao acio akĩmatua Boanerigesi, ũguo nĩ kuuga Ariũ a Marurumĩ); <verse eid="MRK 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 3:18"/>na Anderea, na Filipu na Baritholomayo, na Mathayo, na Toma, na Jakubu wa Alufayo na Thadayo, na Simoni ũrĩa Mũzelote <verse eid="MRK 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 3:19"/>na Judasi Mũisikariota, ũrĩa wamũkunyanĩire.<verse eid="MRK 3:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jesũ na Beelizebuli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 3:20"/>Ningĩ Jesũ agĩtoonya nyũmba, na o rĩngĩ kĩrĩndĩ gĩkĩũngana o nginya we na arutwo ake makĩremwo nĩ kũrĩa irio. <verse eid="MRK 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 3:21"/>Rĩrĩa andũ ao maiguire ũhoro ũcio, magĩthiĩ kũmũnyiita, nĩgũkorwo moigire atĩrĩ, “Nĩagũrũkĩte.”<verse eid="MRK 3:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 3:22"/>Nao arutani a watho arĩa maikũrũkĩte kuuma Jerusalemu makiuga atĩrĩ, “Aiyũrĩtwo nĩ Beelizebuli! Araingata ndaimono na hinya wa mũnene wa ndaimono.”<verse eid="MRK 3:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 3:23"/>Nĩ ũndũ ũcio Jesũ akĩmeeta, na akĩmarĩria na ngerekano, akĩmeera atĩrĩ: “Shaitani angĩhota atĩa kũingata Shaitani? <verse eid="MRK 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 3:24"/>Ũthamaki ũngĩamũkana guo mwene, ũthamaki ũcio ndũngĩtũũra. <verse eid="MRK 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 3:25"/>Nyũmba ĩngĩamũkana na andũ ayo mokanĩrĩre, nyũmba ĩyo ndĩngĩtũũra. <verse eid="MRK 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 3:26"/>Nake Shaitani angĩĩyũkĩrĩra we mwene na aamũkane-rĩ, ndangĩtũũra; nĩ gũthira egũthira. <verse eid="MRK 3:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 3:27"/>Na gũtirĩ mũndũ ũngĩhota gũtoonya nyũmba ya mũndũ njamba na amũtunye indo ciake, tiga ambire kuoha mũndũ ũcio njamba. Hĩndĩ ĩyo no rĩo angĩhota kũmũtunya indo cia nyũmba yake. <verse eid="MRK 3:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 3:28"/>Ndamwĩra atĩrĩ na ma, andũ nĩmakarekerwo mehia mao mothe o na irumi ciao ciothe iria magaakorwo marumĩte Ngai nacio. <verse eid="MRK 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 3:29"/>No ũrĩa wothe ũkaaruma Roho Mũtheru ndarĩ hĩndĩ akarekerwo, nĩehĩtie rĩĩhia rĩa gũtũũra tene na tene.”<verse eid="MRK 3:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 3:30"/>Oigire ũguo tondũ moigaga atĩrĩ, “Arĩ na ngoma thũku.”<verse eid="MRK 3:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nyina na Ariũ a Nyina na Jesũ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 3:31"/>Hĩndĩ ĩyo, nyina wa Jesũ na ariũ a nyina na Jesũ magĩũka. Makĩrũgama nja, magĩtũma mũndũ atoonye akamwĩte. <verse eid="MRK 3:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 3:32"/>Nakĩo gĩkundi kĩa andũ nĩgĩaikarĩte thĩ hau kĩmũrigiicĩirie, nao makĩmwĩra atĩrĩ, “Maitũguo na ariũ a maitũguo marĩ nja magĩgũcaria.”<verse eid="MRK 3:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 3:33"/>Nake akĩmooria atĩrĩ, “Maitũ na ariũ a maitũ nĩ a?”<verse eid="MRK 3:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 3:34"/>Agĩcooka akĩrora arĩa maikarĩte mamũrigiicĩirie, akĩmeera atĩrĩ, “Maitũ na ariũ a maitũ nĩ aya! <verse eid="MRK 3:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 3:35"/>Ũrĩa wothe wĩkaga maũndũ marĩa Ngai endaga, ũcio nĩwe mũrũ wa maitũ, na mwarĩ wa maitũ, o na maitũ.”<verse eid="MRK 3:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MRK 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Ngerekano ya Mũhuri wa Mbeũ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 4:1"/>Nake Jesũ akĩambĩrĩria kũrutana o rĩngĩ arĩ kũu hũgũrũrũ-inĩ cia iria. Na rĩrĩ, gĩkundi kĩa andũ kĩrĩa kĩonganĩte gĩkamũrigiicĩria kĩarĩ kĩnene nginya gĩgĩtũma atoonye gatarũ-inĩ, agĩikara thĩinĩ wako kũu iria-inĩ; nao andũ acio angĩ othe magĩikara hũgũrũrũ-inĩ cia iria. <verse eid="MRK 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 4:2"/>Na akĩmaruta maũndũ maingĩ na ngerekano, na akĩrutana akĩmeera atĩrĩ, <verse eid="MRK 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 4:3"/>“Ta thikĩrĩriai! Mũrĩmi ũmwe nĩoimagarire akahure mbeũ ciake. <verse eid="MRK 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 4:4"/>Na rĩrĩa aahuraga mbeũ icio, imwe ikĩgũa mũkĩra-inĩ wa njĩra, nacio nyoni igĩũka igĩcirĩa. <verse eid="MRK 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 4:5"/>Iria ingĩ ikĩgũa rũnyanjara-inĩ kũrĩa gũtaarĩ na tĩĩri mũingĩ. Nacio ikĩmera narua tondũ tĩĩri ndwarĩ mũriku. <verse eid="MRK 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 4:6"/>No rĩrĩa riũa rĩaarire rĩgĩcina mĩmera ĩyo, nayo ĩkĩũma tondũ ndĩarĩ na mĩri. <verse eid="MRK 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 4:7"/>Mbeũ iria ingĩ ikĩgũa mĩigua-inĩ, nayo mĩigua ĩgĩkũra, ĩgĩthararia mbeũ icio ikĩaga gũciara. <verse eid="MRK 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 4:8"/>Ingĩ nacio ikĩgũa tĩĩri-inĩ mũnoru. Ikĩmera, igĩkũra na igĩciara maciaro, imwe ikiumia maita mĩrongo ĩtatũ, ingĩ maita mĩrongo ĩtandatũ, o na ingĩ maita igana.”<verse eid="MRK 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 4:9"/>Jesũ agĩcooka akiuga atĩrĩ, “Ũrĩa ũrĩ na matũ ma kũigua, nĩakĩigue.”<verse eid="MRK 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 4:10"/>Na rĩrĩa aarĩ wiki, arutwo arĩa ikũmi na eerĩ, o na arĩa angĩ maarĩ hamwe nake, makĩmũũria ũhoro wa ngerekano icio. <verse eid="MRK 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 4:11"/>Nake akĩmeera atĩrĩ, “Inyuĩ nĩmũheetwo ũmenyo wa kũmenya hitho cia ũthamaki wa Ngai. No arĩa marĩ na kũu nja maaragĩrio maũndũ mothe na ngerekano <verse eid="MRK 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 4:12"/>nĩgeetha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">“ ‘matũũre maroraga no makaaga kuona,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 4:12">na matũũre maiguaga na matimenye ũndũ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">nĩguo hihi matikae kũgarũrũka marekerwo mehia mao!’ ”<verse eid="MRK 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 4:13"/>Ningĩ Jesũ akĩmooria atĩrĩ, “Kaĩ mũtanataũkĩrwo nĩ ngerekano ĩyo? Mũngĩkĩmenya atĩa ngerekano iria ingĩ? <verse eid="MRK 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 4:14"/>Mũrĩmi ahuraga kiugo kĩa Ngai. <verse eid="MRK 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 4:15"/>Andũ amwe matariĩ ta mbeũ iria ciagũire njĩra-inĩ harĩa ũhoro ũhuragwo. Acio nĩ arĩa maiguaga ũhoro, na maarĩkia kũigua-rĩ, Shaitani agooka akeheria ũhoro ũcio wahaandwo thĩinĩ wao. <verse eid="MRK 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 4:16"/>Angĩ nao matariĩ ta mbeũ iria ciagũire rũnyanjara-inĩ. Acio nĩ arĩa maiguaga ũhoro na o rĩmwe makawamũkĩra na gĩkeno. <verse eid="MRK 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 4:17"/>No tondũ matirĩ na mĩri-rĩ, maikaraga o kahinda kanini. Hĩndĩ ĩrĩa thĩĩna woka kana maanyariirwo nĩ ũndũ wa ũhoro wa Ngai, magũũaga o narua. <verse eid="MRK 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 4:18"/>Angĩ nao matariĩ ta mbeũ iria ciagũire mĩigua-inĩ. Acio nĩ arĩa maiguaga ũhoro, <verse eid="MRK 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 4:19"/>no mĩhangʼo ya maũndũ ma mũtũũrĩre ũyũ, na kũheenererio nĩ ũtonga, na merirĩria ma maũndũ mangĩ, magathararia ũhoro ũcio, magatũma wage maciaro. <verse eid="MRK 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 4:20"/>Angĩ matariĩ ta mbeũ iria ciagũire tĩĩri-inĩ ũrĩa mũnoru. Acio nĩ arĩa maiguaga ũhoro, makawĩtĩkĩra, na magaciara maciaro, amwe maita mĩrongo ĩtatũ, na angĩ maita mĩrongo ĩtandatũ, o na angĩ maita igana ma kĩrĩa kĩahaandirwo.”<verse eid="MRK 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Tawa Ũigĩrĩirwo Handũ Igũrũ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 4:21"/>Jesũ agĩcooka akĩmooria atĩrĩ, “No anga tawa wakagio ũgacooka ũgakunĩkĩrio na irebe, kana ũkaigwo rungu rwa ũrĩrĩ? Handũ ha ũguo githĩ ndũigagĩrĩrwo handũ igũrũ? <verse eid="MRK 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 4:22"/>Nĩgũkorwo kĩrĩa gĩothe kĩrĩ hitho-inĩ nĩgĩkaguũrio, nakĩo kĩrĩa gĩothe kĩhithĩtwo nĩgĩkareehwo ũtheri-inĩ. <verse eid="MRK 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 4:23"/>Akorwo mũndũ arĩ na matũ ma kũigua, nĩakĩigue.”<verse eid="MRK 4:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 4:24"/>Agĩthiĩ na mbere, akĩmeera atĩrĩ, “Menyagĩrĩrai wega ũrĩa mũiguaga. Gĩthimi kĩrĩa mũthimanagĩra nakĩo, no kĩo mũrĩthimagĩrwo nakĩo, na nĩmũrĩkĩragĩrĩrio. <verse eid="MRK 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 4:25"/>Ũrĩa wothe wĩ na indo nĩakongererwo nyingĩ; na ũrĩa wothe ũtarĩ nĩagatuunywo o na kĩrĩa arĩ nakĩo.”<verse eid="MRK 4:25"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngerekano ya Mbeũ Ĩrakũra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 4:26"/>Jesũ agĩcooka akiuga atĩrĩ, “Ũthamaki wa Ngai ũtariĩ ta mũndũ ũrĩa ũhaandaga mbeũ tĩĩri-inĩ. <verse eid="MRK 4:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 4:27"/>Akomaga ũtukũ na agokĩra mũthenya, nacio mbeũ ikamera na igakũra, nowe ndamenyaga ũrĩa ikũraga. <verse eid="MRK 4:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 4:28"/>Tĩĩri guo mwene nĩguo ũtũmaga iciare. Ciambaga kũruta nguha igacooka ikaruta igira, na thuutha ũcio igira thĩinĩ hakagĩa na hĩndĩ ĩrĩa njiganu. <verse eid="MRK 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 4:29"/>Na maciaro macio maarĩkia kũũma, mũrĩmi ũcio akoya rũhiũ rwa igetha, akagetha tondũ hĩndĩ ya magetha nĩ yakinya.”<verse eid="MRK 4:29"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngerekano ya Mbeũ ya Karatarĩ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 4:30"/>Agĩcooka akiuga atĩrĩ, “Tũngĩhaanania ũthamaki wa Ngai na kĩ? Kana nĩ ngerekano ĩrĩkũ tũngĩheana ũhoro waguo nayo? <verse eid="MRK 4:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 4:31"/>Ũhaana ta mbeũ ya karatarĩ, arĩ yo mbeũ ĩrĩa nini mũno mũhaandaga tĩĩri-inĩ. <verse eid="MRK 4:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 4:32"/>No yahaandwo-rĩ, ĩkũraga ĩgatuĩka mũmera mũnene gũkĩra mĩmera ĩrĩa ĩngĩ yothe ya mũgũnda, na ũkagĩa na honge nene nginya nyoni cia rĩera-inĩ igooka igaaka itara na ikahurũka kĩĩruru-inĩ kĩaguo.”<verse eid="MRK 4:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 4:33"/>Jesũ nĩamaheaga ũhoro na ngerekano ingĩ nyingĩ ta icio o ta ũrĩa mangĩahotire kũigua. <verse eid="MRK 4:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 4:34"/>Gũtirĩ ũndũ aameeraga atekwaria na ngerekano. No rĩrĩa maarĩ na arutwo ake oiki, nĩamataragĩria maũndũ mothe.<verse eid="MRK 4:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jesũ Kũhooreria Makũmbĩ ma Maaĩ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 4:35"/>Na mũthenya o ũcio gwakinya hwaĩ-inĩ-rĩ, akĩĩra arutwo ake atĩrĩ, “Nĩtũringei tũthiĩ mũrĩmo ũũrĩa ũngĩ.” <verse eid="MRK 4:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 4:36"/>Na maarĩkia gũtiga gĩkundi kĩa andũ na thuutha, makĩhaica gatarũ-inĩ o harĩa Jesũ aarĩ. Na nĩ kwarĩ na tũtarũ tũngĩ twatwaranire hamwe nake. <verse eid="MRK 4:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 4:37"/>Na rĩrĩ, kũu iria-inĩ gũkĩgĩa na kĩhuhũkanio kĩnene, namo makũmbĩ ma maaĩ magĩtoonya gatarũ thĩinĩ, o nginya gakĩenda kũũrĩra. <verse eid="MRK 4:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 4:38"/>Jesũ aarĩ toro akomeire muto mũthia-inĩ wa gatarũ. Nao arutwo makĩmũũkĩria makĩmũũria atĩrĩ, “Mũrutani, kaĩ wee ũtaramaka tũkĩũrĩra maaĩ-inĩ?”<verse eid="MRK 4:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 4:39"/>Nake Jesũ agĩũkĩra, agĩkaania rũhuho na akĩĩra makũmbĩ macio ma iria atĩrĩ, “Kira! Na ũhoorere!” Naruo rũhuho rũgĩtiga kũhurutana, gũkĩhoorera biũ.<verse eid="MRK 4:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 4:40"/>Jesũ akĩũria arutwo ake atĩrĩ, “Nĩ kĩĩ gĩtũmĩte mũmake ũguo? O na rĩu mũtirĩ mũretĩkia?”<verse eid="MRK 4:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 4:41"/>Nao magĩĩtigĩra mũno na makĩũrania atĩrĩ, “Kaĩ mũndũ ũyũ akĩrĩ ũũ? Tondũ o na rũhuho na makũmbĩ ma iria nĩiramwathĩkĩra!”<verse eid="MRK 4:41"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MRK 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Kũhonio kwa Mũndũ warĩ na Ndaimono</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 5:1"/>Jesũ na arutwo ake magĩkinya mũrĩmo ũũrĩa ũngĩ wa iria, magĩthiĩ bũrũri wa Agerasi. <verse eid="MRK 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 5:2"/>Na Jesũ aarĩkia kuuma gatarũ-inĩ, agĩtũngwo nĩ mũndũ warĩ na ngoma thũku oimĩte mbĩrĩra-inĩ. <verse eid="MRK 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 5:3"/>Mũndũ ũcio aatũũraga kũu mbĩrĩra-inĩ, na gũtirĩ mũndũ ũngĩahotire kũmuoha na kĩndũ, o na mũnyororo. <verse eid="MRK 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 5:4"/>Nĩgũkorwo nĩohagwo kaingĩ na mĩnyororo moko na magũrũ, no akamĩtuanga icunjĩ na akoinanga igera iria ciamuohaga magũrũ. Na gũtirĩ mũndũ warĩ na hinya wa kũmũhooreria. <verse eid="MRK 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 5:5"/>Aatũũraga akayaga ũtukũ na mũthenya, kũu mbĩrĩra-inĩ na irĩma-inĩ agĩĩtemangaga na mahiga.<verse eid="MRK 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 5:6"/>Rĩrĩa oonire Jesũ arĩ o haraaya akĩhanyũka, akĩĩgũithia thĩ mbere yake. <verse eid="MRK 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 5:7"/>Akĩanĩrĩra na mũgambo mũnene, akiuga atĩrĩ, “Ũrenda atĩa na niĩ, wee Jesũ, Mũrũ wa Ngai-Ũrĩa-Ũrĩ-Igũrũ-Mũno? Ndagũthaitha na Ngai ndũkaanyariire!” <verse eid="MRK 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 5:8"/>Nĩgũkorwo Jesũ aamwĩrĩte atĩrĩ, “Wee ngoma ĩno thũku uma thĩinĩ wa mũndũ ũyũ!”<verse eid="MRK 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 5:9"/>Jesũ agĩcooka akĩmũũria atĩrĩ, “Wĩtagwo atĩa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 5:9">Nake akĩmũcookeria atĩrĩ, “Njĩtagwo Legioni, nĩgũkorwo tũrĩ aingĩ.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Legioni nĩ kiugo gĩa Kĩroma gĩa kuuga “mbũtũ ya thigari ngiri ithathatũ” (6,000).</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 5:10"/>Nake agĩkĩrĩrĩria gũthaitha Jesũ mũno ndagacingate ciume bũrũri ũcio.<verse eid="MRK 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 5:11"/>Na rĩrĩ, haarĩ na rũũru rũnene rwa ngũrwe rwarĩĩaga harũrũka-inĩ cia kĩrĩma kĩarĩ hakuhĩ na hau. <verse eid="MRK 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 5:12"/>Ndaimono icio igĩthaitha Jesũ, ikĩmwĩra atĩrĩ, “Twĩtĩkĩrie tũthiĩ kũrĩ ngũrwe iria, tũtoonye thĩinĩ wacio.” <verse eid="MRK 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 5:13"/>Nake agĩciĩtĩkĩria. Nacio ndaimono icio ikiuma igĩthiĩ igĩtoonya thĩinĩ wa ngũrwe. Rũũru rũu ruothe rwa mũigana wa ngũrwe ngiri igĩrĩ, rũkĩharũrũka kĩhurũrũka-inĩ na ihenya rũgĩtoonya iria-inĩ, rũkĩũrĩra.<verse eid="MRK 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 5:14"/>Arĩa maarĩithagia ngũrwe icio makĩũra, magĩthiĩ kũheana ũhoro ũcio itũũra-inĩ na mĩgũnda-inĩ, nao andũ magĩũka kuona ũrĩa gwekĩkĩte. <verse eid="MRK 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 5:15"/>Na rĩrĩa mookire harĩ Jesũ, makĩona mũndũ ũrĩa warĩ na Legioni ya ndaimono aikarĩte thĩ hau, ehumbĩte nguo na arĩ na meciiria mega; nao magĩĩtigĩra. <verse eid="MRK 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 5:16"/>Andũ arĩa moonete ũndũ ũcio ũgĩĩkwo makĩĩra andũ acio angĩ maũndũ marĩa mekĩkire kũrĩ mũndũ ũcio waiyũrĩtwo nĩ ndaimono, o na makĩmahe ũhoro wa ngũrwe. <verse eid="MRK 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 5:17"/>Nao andũ acio makĩambĩrĩria gũthaitha Jesũ oime bũrũri ũcio wao.<verse eid="MRK 5:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 5:18"/>Rĩrĩa Jesũ aatoonyaga gatarũ, mũndũ ũcio warutĩtwo ndaimono agĩthaitha Jesũ etĩkĩre mathiĩ nake. <verse eid="MRK 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 5:19"/>No Jesũ akĩmũgiria, akĩmwĩra atĩrĩ, “Inũka mũciĩ kũrĩ andũ anyu, ũmeere ũrĩa wothe Mwathani agwĩkĩire, o na ũrĩa akũiguĩrĩire tha.” <verse eid="MRK 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 5:20"/>Nĩ ũndũ ũcio, mũndũ ũcio agĩthiĩ akĩambĩrĩria kũheana ũhoro kũu Dekapoli wa maũndũ marĩa mothe Jesũ aamwĩkĩire. Nao andũ othe makĩgega.<verse eid="MRK 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kairĩtu Gaakuĩte na Mũtumia warĩ Mũrũaru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 5:21"/>Nake Jesũ aarĩkia kũringa rĩngĩ na gatarũ na aakinya mũrĩmo ũrĩa ũngĩ wa iria, kĩrĩndĩ kĩingĩ gĩkĩũngana harĩ we o hau aarĩ hũgũrũrũ-inĩ cia iria. <verse eid="MRK 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 5:22"/>Na hĩndĩ o ĩyo mũnene ũmwe wa thunagogi wetagwo Jairũ agĩũka hau. Oona Jesũ, akĩĩgũithia thĩ magũrũ-inĩ make <verse eid="MRK 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 5:23"/>akĩmũthaitha mũno, akĩmwĩra atĩrĩ, “Kairĩtu gakwa gakirie gũkua. Ndagũthaitha ũũke, ũgakaigĩrĩre moko nĩgeetha kahone, gatũũre muoyo.” <verse eid="MRK 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 5:24"/>Nĩ ũndũ ũcio Jesũ agĩthiĩ nake.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 5:24">Nakĩo kĩrĩndĩ kĩnene gĩkĩmũrũmĩrĩra, na gĩkamũhatĩkaga na mĩena yothe. <verse eid="MRK 5:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 5:25"/>Na rĩrĩ, hau nĩ haarĩ na mũtumia watũire oiraga thakame mĩaka ikũmi na ĩĩrĩ. <verse eid="MRK 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 5:26"/>Nĩathĩĩnĩkĩte mũno agĩthondekwo nĩ mandagĩtarĩ aingĩ, na akahũthĩra kĩrĩa gĩothe aakoretwo nakĩo, no handũ ha kũhona aakĩragĩrĩria o kwĩhĩrwo. <verse eid="MRK 5:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 5:27"/>Rĩrĩa aiguire ũhoro wa Jesũ, agĩũka na thuutha wake gatagatĩ-inĩ ga kĩrĩndĩ, akĩhutia nguo yake, <verse eid="MRK 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 5:28"/>tondũ eeciiririe atĩrĩ, “Ingĩhutia nguo ciake, no hone.” <verse eid="MRK 5:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 5:29"/>O rĩmwe agĩtiga kuura, na akĩigua nĩehererio thĩĩna mwĩrĩ-inĩ wake.<verse eid="MRK 5:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 5:30"/>Nake Jesũ o rĩmwe akĩigua atĩ hinya nĩwoima harĩ we. Akĩĩhũgũrĩra kĩrĩndĩ kĩu akĩũria atĩrĩ, “Nũũ ũcio wahutia nguo ciakwa?”<verse eid="MRK 5:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 5:31"/>Nao arutwo ake makĩmũcookeria atĩrĩ, “Woria ‘Nũũ wahutia?’ ũkĩonaga ũrĩa andũ aya marakũhatĩka?”<verse eid="MRK 5:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 5:32"/>No Jesũ akĩroranga one nũũ wamũhutĩtie. <verse eid="MRK 5:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 5:33"/>Nake mũtumia ũcio, aamenya ũrĩa eekĩtwo, agĩũka, akĩĩgũithia magũrũ-inĩ make akĩinainaga nĩ guoya, akĩmũhe ũhoro wothe ũrĩa watariĩ. <verse eid="MRK 5:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 5:34"/>Nake Jesũ akĩmwĩra atĩrĩ, “Mwarĩ ũyũ, wĩtĩkio waku nĩguo watũma ũhone; thiĩ na thayũ na ũhone mũrimũ waku.”<verse eid="MRK 5:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 5:35"/>O hĩndĩ ĩyo Jesũ akĩaragia-rĩ, hagĩũka andũ moimĩte kwa Jairũ ũrĩa warĩ mũnene wa thunagogi, makĩmwĩra atĩrĩ, “Mwarĩguo nĩakua. Ũgũgĩthĩĩnia mũrutani rĩngĩ nĩkĩ?”<verse eid="MRK 5:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 5:36"/>Nake Jesũ akĩaga gũthikĩrĩria ũguo moigaga, akĩĩra mũnene ũcio wa thunagogi atĩrĩ, “Wee ĩtĩkia na ndũgetigĩre.”<verse eid="MRK 5:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 5:37"/>Jesũ ndetĩkĩririe mũndũ o na ũrĩkũ amũrũmĩrĩre, o tiga Petero na Jakubu na Johana mũrũ wa nyina na Jakubu. <verse eid="MRK 5:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 5:38"/>Na maakinya mũciĩ kwa mũnene ũcio wa thunagogi, Jesũ akĩona andũ magagaĩte makĩrĩraga na makiugagĩrĩria. <verse eid="MRK 5:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 5:39"/>Agĩtoonya thĩinĩ akĩmeera atĩrĩ, “Kĩagago gĩkĩ gĩothe na kĩrĩro nĩ cia kĩ? Mwana ti mũkuũ, no nĩ gũkoma akomete.” <verse eid="MRK 5:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 5:40"/>Nao makĩmũthekerera.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 5:40">Na thuutha wa kũmoimia nja othe, akĩoya ithe na nyina wa mwana na arutwo arĩa aarĩ nao magĩtoonya harĩa mwana ũcio aarĩ. <verse eid="MRK 5:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 5:41"/>Akĩnyiita mwana guoko, akĩmwĩra atĩrĩ, “Talitha kumi!” (naguo wataũrwo nĩ ta kuuga, “Kairĩtu gaka, ndakwĩra atĩrĩ, ũkĩra!”) <verse eid="MRK 5:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 5:42"/>O rĩmwe kairĩtu kau gagĩũkĩra, gakĩambĩrĩria gũthiĩ (nako kaarĩ na ũkũrũ wa mĩaka ikũmi na ĩĩrĩ). Nao mona ũguo makĩgega mũno. <verse eid="MRK 5:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 5:43"/>Nake akĩmakaania mũno matikareke mũndũ o na ũrĩkũ amenye ũhoro ũcio, na akĩmeera makahe kĩndũ gĩa kũrĩa.<verse eid="MRK 5:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MRK 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Mũnabii ũtarĩ Mũtĩĩe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 6:1"/>Thuutha ũcio Jesũ akiuma kũu agĩthiĩ itũũra rĩao, arĩ hamwe na arutwo ake. <verse eid="MRK 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 6:2"/>Mũthenya wa Thabatũ wakinya, Jesũ akĩambĩrĩria kũruta andũ ũhoro arĩ thĩinĩ wa thunagogi, na andũ aingĩ arĩa maamũiguire makĩgega.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:2">Nao makĩũrania atĩrĩ, “Mũndũ ũyũ aarutire maũndũ maya kũ? Nĩ ũũgĩ wa mũthemba ũrĩkũ ũyũ aheetwo, atĩ o na nĩaringaga ciama! <verse eid="MRK 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 6:3"/>Githĩ ũyũ ti ũrĩa bundi wa mbaũ? Githĩ ũyũ ti mũrũ wa Mariamu, o we mũrũ wa nyina na Jakubu na Jusufu na Judasi na Simoni. Na aarĩ a nyina githĩ matirĩ gũkũ hamwe na ithuĩ?” Nao makĩmũrakarĩra.<verse eid="MRK 6:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 6:4"/>Jesũ akĩmeera atĩrĩ, “Kũndũ mũnabii ataheagwo gĩtĩĩo no itũũra-inĩ rĩake, na kwa andũ a nyũmba yao, na gwake mũciĩ.” <verse eid="MRK 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 6:5"/>Nake Jesũ ndaahotire kũringa ciama kũu, o tiga atĩ nĩaigĩrĩire andũ mataarĩ aingĩ moko arĩa maarĩ arũaru nao makĩhona. <verse eid="MRK 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 6:6"/>Nake akĩgega nĩ ũndũ wa ũrĩa maagĩte wĩtĩkio.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="MRK 6:6">Jesũ Gũtũma Arutwo arĩa Ikũmi na Eerĩ</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:6">Jesũ agĩcooka agĩthiĩ akĩrutanaga itũũra gwa itũũra. <verse eid="MRK 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 6:7"/>Agĩcooka agĩĩta arutwo arĩa ikũmi na eerĩ, akĩmatũma mathiĩ eerĩ eerĩ na akĩmahe ũhoti wa kũingata ngoma thũku.<verse eid="MRK 6:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 6:8"/>Na akĩmeera atĩrĩ, “Mũtigekuuĩre kĩndũ o nakĩ rũgendo-inĩ tiga o mũtirima; na mũtigakuue mũgate, kana mondo, kana mbeeca ibeeti-inĩ cianyu. <verse eid="MRK 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 6:9"/>Ĩkĩrai iraatũ no mũtigakuue nguo cia kũgarũrĩra. <verse eid="MRK 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 6:10"/>Rĩrĩa rĩothe mwatoonya nyũmba, ikarai kuo nginya rĩrĩa mũkoima itũũra rĩu. <verse eid="MRK 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 6:11"/>Na kũrĩa andũ matakamũnyiita ũgeni kana marege kũmũthikĩrĩria-rĩ, mũkiuma kuo mũkaaribariba magũrũ manyu rũkũngũ rũitĩke, rũtuĩke ũira wa kũmatuĩra ciira.”<verse eid="MRK 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 6:12"/>Nao makiumagara magĩthiĩ makĩhunjagia atĩ andũ merire. <verse eid="MRK 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 6:13"/>Ningĩ makĩingata ndaimono nyingĩ na magĩitĩrĩria andũ aingĩ arĩa maarĩ arũaru maguta nao makĩhona.<verse eid="MRK 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Johana Mũbatithania Kũrengwo Mũtwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 6:14"/>Mũthamaki Herode nĩaiguire ũhoro ũcio, nĩgũkorwo rĩĩtwa rĩa Jesũ nĩrĩagĩte igweta mũno. Andũ amwe moigaga atĩrĩ, “Johana Mũbatithania nĩariũkĩte kuuma kũrĩ arĩa akuũ, na nĩkĩo arĩ na hinya mũnene ũguo wa kũringa ciama.”<verse eid="MRK 6:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 6:15"/>Angĩ nao makoiga atĩrĩ, “Ũyũ nĩ Elija.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:15">Angĩ nao makoiga atĩrĩ, “Ũyũ nĩ mũnabii ta ũmwe wa arĩa a tene.”<verse eid="MRK 6:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 6:16"/>Nowe Herode rĩrĩa aiguire ũhoro ũcio, akiuga atĩrĩ, “Johana, mũndũ ũrĩa ndaatinithirie mũtwe-rĩ, nĩariũkĩte kuuma kũrĩ arĩa akuũ!”<verse eid="MRK 6:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 6:17"/>Nĩgũkorwo, Herode we mwene nĩanyiitithĩtie Johana na akamũikithia njeera. Eekĩte ũguo nĩ ũndũ wa Herodia, ũrĩa warĩ mũtumia wa mũrũ wa nyina Filipu, nĩgũkorwo Herode nĩamũhikĩtie. <verse eid="MRK 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 6:18"/>Nake Johana nĩeraga Herode atĩrĩ, “Ndũrĩ na rũtha kũhikia mũtumia wa mũrũ wa maitũguo.” <verse eid="MRK 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 6:19"/>Nĩ ũndũ ũcio Herodia agĩtuma Johana ũthũ na akĩenda kũmũũragithia. No ndangĩahotire gwĩka ũguo, <verse eid="MRK 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 6:20"/>nĩgũkorwo Herode nĩetigĩrĩte Johana na akamũgitagĩra, tondũ nĩoĩ atĩ aarĩ mũndũ mũthingu na mũtheru. Herode nĩathikagĩrĩria Johana, no nĩatangĩkaga mũno amũigua; no nĩendaga mũno kũmũthikĩrĩria.<verse eid="MRK 6:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 6:21"/>Na rĩrĩ, mũthenya ũmwe Herodia nĩagĩire na mweke. Herode nĩarugithirie iruga inene rĩa kũririkana mũthenya wa gũciarwo gwake, nake agĩĩta anene arĩa maamũteithagia na atongoria ake a mbũtũ cia ita, na andũ arĩa maarĩ igweta kũu Galili. <verse eid="MRK 6:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 6:22"/>Na rĩrĩa mwarĩ wa Herodia aatoonyire kũu maarĩ na akĩina-rĩ, agĩkenia Herode na ageni ake arĩa meetĩtwo iruga rĩu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:22">Mũthamaki akĩĩra mũirĩtu ũcio atĩrĩ, “Hooya o kĩrĩa gĩothe ũngĩenda na nĩngũkũhe.” <verse eid="MRK 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 6:23"/>Akĩĩhĩta, akĩmwĩra atĩrĩ, “Kĩrĩa gĩothe ũngĩhooya nĩngũkũhe, o na angĩkorwo nĩ nuthu ya ũthamaki wakwa.”<verse eid="MRK 6:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 6:24"/>Mũirĩtu ũcio agĩthiĩ akĩũria nyina atĩrĩ, “Nĩ kĩĩ ngwĩtia?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:24">Nyina akĩmũcookeria atĩrĩ, “Ĩtia mũtwe wa Johana Mũbatithania.”<verse eid="MRK 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 6:25"/>O rĩmwe mũirĩtu ũcio akĩhiũha, agĩtoonya he mũthamaki, akĩmwĩra atĩrĩ, “Ngwenda ũũhe o rĩu mũtwe wa Johana Mũbatithania ũrĩ thĩinĩ wa kiuga.”<verse eid="MRK 6:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 6:26"/>Mũthamaki akĩigua kĩeha mũno, no tondũ wa mwĩhĩtwa wake na nĩ ũndũ wa ageni ake, ndangĩaregire gwĩka ũguo orĩtio. <verse eid="MRK 6:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 6:27"/>Nĩ ũndũ ũcio agĩtũma mũthigari ũmwe wa arĩa maamũrangagĩra, o hĩndĩ ĩyo akĩmwatha athiĩ arehe mũtwe wa Johana. Mũndũ ũcio agĩthiĩ njeera agĩtinia Johana mũtwe <verse eid="MRK 6:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 6:28"/>akĩũrehe na kiuga, akĩnengera mũirĩtu ũcio, nake akĩũnengera nyina. <verse eid="MRK 6:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 6:29"/>Nao arutwo a Johana maigua ũhoro ũcio, magĩũka, makĩoya mwĩrĩ wake, magĩthiĩ, makĩũthika.<verse eid="MRK 6:29"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jesũ kũhe Andũ Ngiri Ithano Irio</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 6:30"/>Atũmwo nĩmagomanire harĩ Jesũ, makĩmwĩra maũndũ marĩa mothe meekĩte, na marĩa maarutĩte andũ. <verse eid="MRK 6:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 6:31"/>Na tondũ wa ũrĩa andũ aingĩ mookaga magĩthiiaga-rĩ, matingĩahotire kuona o na hĩndĩ ya kũrĩa irio, nake Jesũ akĩmeera atĩrĩ, “Ũkai inyuĩ oiki, tũthiĩ handũ hatarĩ inegene, tũkahurũke.”<verse eid="MRK 6:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 6:32"/>Nĩ ũndũ ũcio makĩingĩra gatarũ marĩ oiki, magĩthiĩ handũ hataarĩ andũ. <verse eid="MRK 6:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 6:33"/>Nao andũ aingĩ arĩa maamonire magĩthiĩ, makĩmamenya, magĩtengʼera na magũrũ moimĩte matũũra-inĩ mothe, magĩkinya mbere yao. <verse eid="MRK 6:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 6:34"/>Na rĩrĩa Jesũ oimire gatarũ, akĩona andũ aingĩ, akĩmaiguĩra tha, tondũ maatariĩ ta ngʼondu itarĩ na mũrĩithi. Nĩ ũndũ ũcio akĩambĩrĩria kũmaruta maũndũ maingĩ.<verse eid="MRK 6:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 6:35"/>Na gwatua gũtuka, arutwo ake magĩthiĩ kũrĩ we, makĩmwĩra atĩrĩ, “Gũkũ nĩ werũ-inĩ na rĩu gũkiriĩ gũtuka. <verse eid="MRK 6:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 6:36"/>Ĩra andũ aya mathiĩ nĩguo makinye mĩgũnda-inĩ na matũũra-inĩ marĩa me hakuhĩ makegũrĩre kĩndũ gĩa kũrĩa.”<verse eid="MRK 6:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 6:37"/>Nowe akĩmacookeria akĩmeera atĩrĩ, “Maheei kĩndũ gĩa kũrĩa arĩ inyuĩ.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:37">Nao makĩmũũria atĩrĩ, “Ũrenda tũthiĩ tũkagũre mĩgate ya dinari magana meerĩ tũmahe marĩe?”<verse eid="MRK 6:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 6:38"/>Nake akĩmooria atĩrĩ, “Mũrĩ na mĩgate ĩigana? Thiĩi mũrore.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:38">Hĩndĩ ĩrĩa maarorire makĩmwĩra atĩrĩ, “Harĩ na mĩgate ĩtano, na thamaki igĩrĩ.”<verse eid="MRK 6:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 6:39"/>Nake Jesũ agĩathana andũ othe maikare thĩ ikundi ikundi kũu nyeki-inĩ ĩrĩa yarĩ ho nduru. <verse eid="MRK 6:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 6:40"/>Nĩ ũndũ ũcio magĩikara thĩ marĩ ikundi cia andũ igana na cia andũ mĩrongo ĩtano. <verse eid="MRK 6:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 6:41"/>Nake akĩoya mĩgate ĩyo ĩtano na thamaki icio igĩrĩ, akĩrora na igũrũ, agĩcookia ngaatho na akĩenyũranga mĩgate ĩyo. Agĩcooka akĩmĩnengera arutwo ake mahe andũ. Ningĩ akĩoya thamaki icio igĩrĩ akĩmagayania othe. <verse eid="MRK 6:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 6:42"/>Nao othe makĩrĩa makĩhũũna, <verse eid="MRK 6:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 6:43"/>nao arutwo makĩũngania cienyũ cia mĩgate na cia thamaki iria ciatigarĩte makĩiyũria ciondo ikũmi na igĩrĩ. <verse eid="MRK 6:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 6:44"/>Mũigana wa arũme arĩa othe maarĩire irio icio maarĩ ngiri ithano.<verse eid="MRK 6:44"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jesũ Kũgerera Maaĩ Igũrũ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 6:45"/>Na hĩndĩ o ĩyo Jesũ akĩĩra arutwo ake matoonye gatarũ mathiiage mbere yake makinye Bethisaida, mũira wa oigĩre kĩrĩndĩ ũhoro. <verse eid="MRK 6:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 6:46"/>Thuutha wa kũmoigĩra ũhoro, akĩambata kĩrĩma-inĩ agĩthiĩ kũhooya.<verse eid="MRK 6:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 6:47"/>Na gũgĩkinya hwaĩ-inĩ, gatarũ kaarĩ gatagatĩ ka iria, nake Jesũ aarĩ thĩ nyũmũ arĩ wiki. <verse eid="MRK 6:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 6:48"/>Nake akĩona arutwo makĩĩgũmĩra gũtwara gatarũ, tondũ rũhuho rwerekeire na kũrĩa moimaga. Na rĩrĩ, ta thaa kenda cia ũtukũ, Jesũ agĩthiĩ kũrĩ o agereire maaĩ igũrũ. Nake aarĩ o hakuhĩ kũmahĩtũka, <verse eid="MRK 6:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 6:49"/>no-o mamuona agereire maaĩ igũrũ magĩĩciiria nĩ ngoma moonaga. Magĩkaya <verse eid="MRK 6:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 6:50"/>tondũ othe nĩmamuonire na magĩĩtigĩra mũno.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:50">O hĩndĩ ĩyo Jesũ akĩmeera atĩrĩ, “Ũmĩrĩriai! Nĩ niĩ. Tigai gwĩtigĩra.” <verse eid="MRK 6:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 6:51"/>Agĩcooka agĩtoonya gatarũ kau maarĩ, naruo rũhuho rũgĩtuĩka. Nao makĩgega mũno, <verse eid="MRK 6:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 6:52"/>tondũ matiataũkĩirwo nĩ ũhoro wa mĩgate ĩyo; ngoro ciao ciarĩ o nyũmũ.<verse eid="MRK 6:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 6:53"/>Na maarĩkia kũringa mũrĩmo ũrĩa ũngĩ, magĩkinya Genesareti, makĩoha gatarũ kao hũgũrũrũ-inĩ cia iria. <verse eid="MRK 6:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 6:54"/>Maarĩkia kuuma gatarũ-inĩ, o rĩmwe andũ makĩmenya Jesũ. <verse eid="MRK 6:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 6:55"/>Magĩtuĩkania bũrũri-inĩ ũcio wothe magakuuaga andũ arĩa maarĩ arũaru na ibarĩ, makĩmatwaraga kũrĩa guothe maiguaga atĩ nĩkuo arĩ. <verse eid="MRK 6:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 6:56"/>Na kũrĩa guothe aathiiaga, mĩciĩ-inĩ, na tũtũũra-inĩ o na kana mĩgũnda-inĩ, o maigaga arĩa arũaru ndũnyũ-inĩ, na makamũthaitha ametĩkĩrie naarĩ mahutie gĩcũrĩ kĩa nguo yake, na arĩa othe maamũhutirie makĩhona.<verse eid="MRK 6:56"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MRK 7"/>
  <para style="s1">Kĩndũ kĩrĩ Thaahu na Gĩtarĩ Thaahu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 7:1"/>Na rĩrĩ, Afarisai na arutani amwe a watho arĩa moimĩte Jerusalemu makĩũngana harĩ Jesũ na <verse eid="MRK 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 7:2"/>makĩona arutwo ake amwe makĩrĩa irio na moko maarĩ na thaahu, ũguo nĩ ta kuuga, matethambĩte moko. <verse eid="MRK 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 7:3"/>(Afarisai na Ayahudi othe matirĩĩaga irio matethambĩte moko mao wega kũringana na kĩrĩra gĩa athuuri. <verse eid="MRK 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 7:4"/>Rĩrĩa moima ndũnyũ matingĩrĩa matambĩte gwĩthamba. Na nĩ marũmagia irĩra ingĩ, ta gũthambia ikombe, na nyũngũ o na mbirika).<verse eid="MRK 7:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 7:5"/>Nĩ ũndũ ũcio Afarisai na Arutani a watho makĩũria Jesũ atĩrĩ, “Nĩ kĩĩ gĩtũmaga arutwo aku mage gũtũũra kũringana na irĩra cia athuuri, na makarĩĩaga irio na moko marĩ na thaahu?”<verse eid="MRK 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 7:6"/>Nake Jesũ akĩmacookeria atĩrĩ, “Isaia aaririe ma rĩrĩa aarathire ũhoro wanyu, inyuĩ hinga ici; o ta ũrĩa kwandĩkĩtwo atĩrĩ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:6">“ ‘Andũ aya maaheaga gĩtĩĩo na mĩromo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 7:6">no ngoro ciao ikoragwo irĩ kũraya na niĩ.<verse eid="MRK 7:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 7:7"/>Nao maahooyaga o tũhũ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 7:7">morutani marĩa marutanaga no mawatho ma andũ.’<verse eid="MRK 7:7"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 7:8"/>Mũtiganĩirie maathani ma Ngai, mũkarũmia irĩra cia andũ.”<verse eid="MRK 7:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 7:9"/>Agĩcooka akĩmeera atĩrĩ, “Ti-itherũ nĩmũgĩĩte na njĩra njega ya gũtiganĩria maathani ma Ngai atĩ nĩguo mũrũmie irĩra cianyu ene! <verse eid="MRK 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 7:10"/>Nĩgũkorwo Musa oigire atĩrĩ, ‘Tĩĩa thoguo na nyũkwa,’ na, ‘Ũrĩa wothe ũkaaruma ithe kana nyina no nginya ooragwo.’ <verse eid="MRK 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 7:11"/>No inyuĩ muugaga atĩ mũndũ angĩĩra ithe kana nyina atĩrĩ, ‘Kĩrĩa ingĩagũteithia nakĩo nĩ Korubani’ (ũguo nĩ kuuga, nĩ kĩheo kĩamũrĩre Ngai), <verse eid="MRK 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 7:12"/>na mũticookaga kũmwĩtĩkĩria ekĩre ithe kana nyina ũndũ. <verse eid="MRK 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 7:13"/>Nĩ ũndũ ũcio mũkaagithia kiugo kĩa Ngai kĩene na ũndũ wa kĩrĩra kĩanyu kĩrĩa mũthiiaga mũgĩtiganagĩra. Na nĩmwĩkaga maũndũ maingĩ ta macio.”<verse eid="MRK 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 7:14"/>O rĩngĩ Jesũ agĩĩta kĩrĩndĩ harĩ we agĩkĩĩra atĩrĩ, “Inyuĩ andũ aya othe, thikĩrĩriai na mũigue. <verse eid="MRK 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 7:15"/>Gũtirĩ kĩndũ kĩrĩ nja ya mũndũ kĩngĩmũgwatia ‘thaahu’ nĩ ũndũ wa gũtoonya thĩinĩ wake. No rĩrĩ, kĩrĩa kiumaga thĩinĩ wa mũndũ nĩkĩo kĩmũgwatagia ‘thaahu’.” <verse eid="MRK 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 7:16"/>(Aakorwo mũndũ arĩ na matũ ma kũigua, nĩakĩigue).<verse eid="MRK 7:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 7:17"/>Thuutha wa gũtigana na kĩrĩndĩ na gũtoonya nyũmba, arutwo ake makĩmũũria ũhoro wa ngerekano ĩyo. <verse eid="MRK 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 7:18"/>Nake Jesũ akĩmooria atĩrĩ, “O na inyuĩ mũtirĩ mũrataũkĩrwo o na rĩu? Kaĩ mũtooĩ atĩ gũtirĩ kĩndũ gĩtoonyaga thĩinĩ wa mũndũ kuuma na nja kĩngĩmũgwatia thaahu? <verse eid="MRK 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 7:19"/>Nĩgũkorwo gĩtitoonyaga ngoro-inĩ yake, no gĩtoonyaga nda yake gĩgacooka gĩkoima mwĩrĩ-inĩ wake.” (Akiuga ũguo-rĩ, Jesũ nĩgũtua aatuaga atĩ irio ciothe itirĩ thaahu).<verse eid="MRK 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 7:20"/>Agĩthiĩ na mbere na kwaria, akiuga atĩrĩ, “Kĩrĩa kiumaga thĩinĩ wa mũndũ nĩkĩo kĩmũgwatagia thaahu. <verse eid="MRK 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 7:21"/>Nĩgũkorwo ngoro-inĩ cia andũ nĩkuo kuumaga meciiria mooru, ũhũũri maraya, na ũici, na ũragani, na ũtharia, <verse eid="MRK 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 7:22"/>na ũkoroku, na rũmena, na maheeni, na ũũra-thoni, na ũiru, na njambanio, na mwĩtĩĩo, o na ũrimũ. <verse eid="MRK 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 7:23"/>Maũru maya mothe moimaga thĩinĩ wa mũndũ na makamũgwatia thaahu.”<verse eid="MRK 7:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wĩtĩkio wa Mũtumia Mũfoinike</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 7:24"/>Nake Jesũ akiuma kũu agĩthiĩ gũkuhĩ na Turo. Agĩtoonya nyũmba ĩmwe na ndeendaga mũndũ o na ũrĩkũ amenye atĩ arĩ kũu; no ndangĩahotire kwĩhitha. <verse eid="MRK 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 7:25"/>Na rĩrĩ, mũtumia warĩ na kairĩtu kaarĩ na ngoma thũku rĩrĩa aiguire ũhoro wake, agĩũka akĩĩgũithia thĩ magũrũ-inĩ make. <verse eid="MRK 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 7:26"/>Mũtumia ũcio aarĩ Mũyunani, waciarĩirwo Foinike ya Suriata. Nake agĩthaitha Jesũ aingate ngoma ĩyo thũku yume thĩinĩ wa kairĩtu gake.<verse eid="MRK 7:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 7:27"/>Nake Jesũ akĩmwĩra atĩrĩ, “Reke ciana ciambe irĩe ihũũne, nĩgũkorwo ti wega kuoya mĩgate ya ciana na kũmĩikĩria ngui.”<verse eid="MRK 7:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 7:28"/>Nake mũtumia ũcio akĩmũcookeria atĩrĩ, “Noguo Mwathani, no o na ngui irĩ rungu rwa metha nĩ irĩĩaga rũitĩki rũrĩa rũitagwo nĩ ciana.”<verse eid="MRK 7:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 7:29"/>Jesũ agĩcooka akĩmwĩra atĩrĩ, “Nĩ ũndũ wa ũguo wacookia-rĩ, wĩthiĩre; ndaimono nĩyoima thĩinĩ wa mwarĩguo.”<verse eid="MRK 7:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 7:30"/>Mũtumia ũcio akĩinũka mũciĩ agĩkora kaana gake gakomete ũrĩrĩ-inĩ na ndaimono ĩrĩkĩtie gũthiĩ.<verse eid="MRK 7:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kũhonio kwa Mũndũ Ũtaiguaga na Ũtaaragia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 7:31"/>Ningĩ Jesũ akiuma kũu gũkuhĩ na Turo agĩtuĩkanĩria Sidoni, agĩikũrũka nginya iria-inĩ rĩa Galili, agĩtoonya bũrũri wa Dekapoli. <verse eid="MRK 7:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 7:32"/>Arĩ kũu andũ amwe makĩmũrehere mũndũ ũtaiguaga na ũtaaragia, makĩmũthaitha amũigĩrĩre guoko.<verse eid="MRK 7:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 7:33"/>Na thuutha wa kũmũtwara handũ keheri-inĩ, haraaya na kĩrĩndĩ, Jesũ agĩtoonyia ciara ciake matũ ma mũndũ ũcio. Agĩcooka agĩtua mata na akĩhutia rũrĩmĩ rwa mũndũ ũcio namo. <verse eid="MRK 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 7:34"/>Akĩrora na igũrũ, akĩhũmũka na hinya, akĩmwĩra atĩrĩ, “Efatha!” (ũguo nĩ kuuga, “Hingũka!”). <verse eid="MRK 7:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 7:35"/>Aarĩkia kuuga ũguo matũ ma mũndũ ũcio makĩhingũka na rũrĩmĩ rwake rũkĩregera akĩambĩrĩria kwaria o wega.<verse eid="MRK 7:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 7:36"/>Nake Jesũ akĩmaatha matikeere mũndũ o na ũrĩkũ. No ũrĩa akĩragĩrĩria kũmakaania, noguo makĩragĩrĩria kwaria mũno ũhoro ũcio. <verse eid="MRK 7:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 7:37"/>Nao andũ makĩgega mũno makĩria, makiuga atĩrĩ, “Nĩekĩte maũndũ mothe wega. O na agatũmaga andũ arĩa mataiguaga maigue na arĩa mataaragia maarie.”<verse eid="MRK 7:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MRK 8"/>
  <para style="s1">Jesũ kũhe Andũ Ngiri Inya Irio</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 8:1"/>Na rĩrĩ, matukũ-inĩ macio kĩrĩndĩ kĩingĩ gĩkĩũngana rĩngĩ. Na tondũ gĩtiarĩ na kĩndũ gĩa kũrĩa-rĩ, Jesũ agĩĩta arutwo ake moke harĩ we, akĩmeera atĩrĩ, <verse eid="MRK 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 8:2"/>“Nĩndĩraiguĩra andũ aya tha Nĩgũkorwo makoretwo hamwe na niĩ rĩu mĩthenya ĩtatũ na matirĩ na kĩndũ gĩa kũrĩa. <verse eid="MRK 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 8:3"/>Ingĩmeera mainũke mahũũtiĩ mekũringĩkĩra njĩra, tondũ amwe ao moimĩte kũraya.”<verse eid="MRK 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 8:4"/>Nao arutwo makĩmũcookeria atĩrĩ, “Mũndũ angĩruta irio cia kũmahũũnia kũ gũkũ werũ-inĩ ũyũ?”<verse eid="MRK 8:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 8:5"/>Jesũ akĩmooria atĩrĩ, “Mũrĩ na mĩgate ĩigana?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:5">Nao makĩmũcookeria atĩrĩ, “Tũrĩ na mĩgate mũgwanja.”<verse eid="MRK 8:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 8:6"/>Akĩĩra kĩrĩndĩ gĩikare thĩ. Nake akĩoya mĩgate ĩyo mũgwanja, na aarĩkia gũcookia ngaatho akĩenyũranga mĩgate ĩyo, akĩmĩnengera arutwo ake mahe andũ, nao magĩĩka o ũguo. <verse eid="MRK 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 8:7"/>O na nĩ maarĩ na tũthamaki tũnini tũtarĩ tũingĩ; agĩcookia ngaatho nĩ ũndũ watuo, na akĩĩra arutwo magaĩre andũ. <verse eid="MRK 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 8:8"/>Nao makĩrĩa makĩhũũna. Thuutha ũcio arutwo makĩũngania cienyũ iria ciatigarĩte, ikĩiyũra ciondo mũgwanja. <verse eid="MRK 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 8:9"/>Andũ arũme arĩa maarĩire maarĩ ta ngiri inya. Na aarĩkia kũmeera mathiĩ, <verse eid="MRK 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 8:10"/>agĩtoonya gatarũ me na arutwo ake, magĩthiĩ bũrũri wa Dalumanutha.<verse eid="MRK 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 8:11"/>Nao Afarisai magĩũka na makĩambĩrĩria kũũria Jesũ ciũria. Makĩmwĩra aringe kĩama kuuma igũrũ no nĩkũmũgeria maamũgeragia. <verse eid="MRK 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 8:12"/>Nake akĩhũmũka ihũmũka inene, akĩũria atĩrĩ, “Nĩkĩ gĩgũtũma rũciaro rũrũ rũũrie rũringĩrwo kĩama? Ngũmwĩra atĩrĩ na ma gũtirĩ kĩama rũkũringĩrwo.” <verse eid="MRK 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 8:13"/>Agĩcooka akĩmatiga, agĩtoonya gatarũ akĩringa mũrĩmo ũrĩa ũngĩ.<verse eid="MRK 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ndawa ya Kũimbia Mĩgate ya Afarisai na ya Herode</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 8:14"/>Na rĩrĩ, arutwo nĩmariganĩirwo nĩ gũkuua mĩgate, tiga o mũgate ũmwe marĩ naguo gatarũ-inĩ. <verse eid="MRK 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 8:15"/>Nake Jesũ akĩmataara akĩmeera atĩrĩ, “Mwĩmenyererei. Mwĩhũgagei ndawa ya kũimbia mĩgate ya Afarisai na ya Herode.”<verse eid="MRK 8:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 8:16"/>Nao makĩaranĩria ũhoro ũcio mũndũ na ũrĩa ũngĩ, makĩĩrana atĩrĩ, “Aratwĩra ũguo tondũ tũtirĩ na mĩgate.”<verse eid="MRK 8:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 8:17"/>Jesũ aamenya ũrĩa meeranaga akĩmooria atĩrĩ, “Nĩ kĩĩ kĩratũma mwaranĩrie ũhoro wa kwaga mĩgate? Nginya rĩu mũtirĩ mũrataũkĩrwo o na kana mũkamenya? Nĩ kũũmia mũũmĩtie ngoro cianyu? <verse eid="MRK 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 8:18"/>Anga mũrĩ na maitho na mũtionaga, na mũrĩ na matũ na mũtiiguaga? Kaĩ mũtararirikana? <verse eid="MRK 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 8:19"/>Rĩrĩa ndenyũrangĩire andũ arĩa ngiri ithano mĩgate ĩrĩa ĩtano-rĩ, nĩ ciondo ciigana muonganirie ciiyũrĩte cienyũ cia mĩgate?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:19">Nao makĩmũcookeria atĩrĩ, “Ciarĩ ciondo ikũmi na igĩrĩ.”<verse eid="MRK 8:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 8:20"/>“Na rĩrĩa ndenyũrangĩire andũ arĩa ngiri inya mĩgate ĩrĩa mũgwanja-rĩ, nĩ ciondo ciigana muonganirie ciiyũrĩte cienyũ cia mĩgate?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:20">Nao makĩmũcookeria atĩrĩ, “Ciarĩ ciondo mũgwanja.”<verse eid="MRK 8:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 8:21"/>Akĩmooria atĩrĩ, “Kaĩ mũtarĩ mũrataũkĩrwo nĩ ũhoro nginya rĩu?”<verse eid="MRK 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kũhonio kwa Mũtumumu Karia-inĩ ka Bethisaida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 8:22"/>Na maakinya Bethisaida, andũ amwe makĩmũrehera mũndũ warĩ mũtumumu, na magĩthaitha Jesũ amũhutie. <verse eid="MRK 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 8:23"/>Akĩnyiita mũndũ ũcio mũtumumu guoko, akĩmuumia na nja ya itũũra. Na aarĩkia kũmũtuĩra mata maitho na kũmũigĩrĩra moko, Jesũ akĩmũũria atĩrĩ, “Nĩ kũrĩ kĩndũ ũroona?”<verse eid="MRK 8:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 8:24"/>Nake agĩtiira maitho, akiuga atĩrĩ, “Nĩndĩrona andũ; no ngoona mahaana ta mĩtĩ magĩthiĩ.”<verse eid="MRK 8:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 8:25"/>O rĩngĩ Jesũ akĩigĩrĩra mũndũ ũcio moko maitho. Hĩndĩ ĩyo maitho make makĩhingũka, agĩcooka kuona na akĩona indo ciothe wega. <verse eid="MRK 8:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 8:26"/>Jesũ akĩmwĩra atĩrĩ, “Inũka, na ndũgatoonye itũũra-inĩ.”<verse eid="MRK 8:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Petero Kuumbũra Kristũ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 8:27"/>Jesũ na arutwo ake magĩthiĩ na mbere o nginya tũtũũra-inĩ tũrĩa twarigiicĩirie Kaisarea-Filipi. Na me njĩra-inĩ akĩmooria atĩrĩ, “Andũ moigaga niĩ nĩ niĩ ũ?”<verse eid="MRK 8:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 8:28"/>Nao makĩmũcookeria atĩrĩ, “Amwe moigaga wee nĩwe Johana Mũbatithania; angĩ makoiga wee nĩwe Elija; o na angĩ moigaga wee ũrĩ ũmwe wa anabii.”<verse eid="MRK 8:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 8:29"/>Nake akĩmooria atĩrĩ, “Inyuĩ na inyuĩ muugaga atĩa? Muugaga niĩ nĩ niĩ ũ?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:29">Petero akĩmũcookeria atĩrĩ, “Wee nĩwe Kristũ.”<verse eid="MRK 8:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 8:30"/>Nake Jesũ akĩmakaania matikeere mũndũ o na ũrĩkũ ũhoro wake.<verse eid="MRK 8:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jesũ Kuumbũra Ũhoro wa Gĩkuũ Gĩake Gĩtanakinya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 8:31"/>Ningĩ Jesũ akĩambĩrĩria kũmaruta atĩ Mũrũ wa Mũndũ no nginya one mathĩĩna maingĩ na aregwo nĩ athuuri, na athĩnjĩri-Ngai arĩa anene o na arutani a watho, na atĩ no nginya ooragwo, na thuutha wa mĩthenya ĩtatũ ariũke. <verse eid="MRK 8:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 8:32"/>Aaririe ũhoro ũcio atekũhitha, nake Petero akĩmũtwara keheri-inĩ, akĩambĩrĩria kũmũkaania.<verse eid="MRK 8:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 8:33"/>No Jesũ akĩĩhũgũra akĩrora arutwo ake, na agĩkũũma Petero, akiuga atĩrĩ, “Cooka thuutha wakwa, Shaitani! Wee ndwĩciiragia maũndũ moimĩte kũrĩ Ngai, tiga o maũndũ marĩa moimĩte kũrĩ andũ.”<verse eid="MRK 8:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 8:34"/>Agĩcooka agĩĩta kĩrĩndĩ hamwe na arutwo ake moke harĩ we, akĩmeera atĩrĩ, “Mũndũ o wothe ũngĩenda kũnũmĩrĩra, no nginya eerege we mwene, na akuue mũtharaba wake anũmĩrĩre. <verse eid="MRK 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 8:35"/>Nĩgũkorwo ũrĩa wothe wendaga kũhonokia muoyo wake nĩ kũũrwo akoorwo nĩguo, no ũrĩa wothe ũkoorwo nĩ muoyo wake nĩ ũndũ wakwa na nĩ ũndũ wa Ũhoro-ũrĩa-Mwega, nĩakaũhonokia. <verse eid="MRK 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 8:36"/>Mũndũ angĩĩguna nakĩ angĩĩgwatĩra thĩ yothe, no orwo nĩ muoyo wake? <verse eid="MRK 8:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 8:37"/>Kana nĩ kĩĩ mũndũ angĩkũũrania na muoyo wake? <verse eid="MRK 8:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 8:38"/>Mũndũ o wothe ũngĩconoka nĩ ũndũ wakwa na aconoke nĩ ũndũ wa ciugo ciakwa hĩndĩ ĩno ya rũciaro rũrũ rwa ũtharia na rwa mehia, o nake Mũrũ wa Mũndũ nĩakamũconokera rĩrĩa agaacooka arĩ na riiri wa Ithe, arĩ na araika arĩa atheru.”<verse eid="MRK 8:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MRK 9"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 9:1"/>Jesũ agĩcooka akĩmeera atĩrĩ, “Ngũmwĩra atĩrĩ na ma, amwe marũngiĩ haha matigacama gĩkuũ matonete ũthamaki wa Ngai ũgĩũka wĩ na hinya!”<verse eid="MRK 9:1"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jesũ Kũgarũrũka ũrĩa Aatariĩ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 9:2"/>Thuutha wa mĩthenya ĩtandatũ, Jesũ nĩmathiire na Petero na Jakubu na Johana, akĩmatwara kĩrĩma-inĩ kĩraaya, marĩ oiki. Na rĩrĩ, arĩ hau mbere yao akĩgarũrũka ũrĩa aahaanaga. <verse eid="MRK 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 9:3"/>Nguo ciake ikĩerũha cua; gũtirĩ mũndũ gũkũ thĩ ũngĩahotire gũcithambia cierũhe ũguo. <verse eid="MRK 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 9:4"/>Na marĩ o hau makiumĩrĩrwo nĩ Elija na Musa, makĩaranĩria na Jesũ.<verse eid="MRK 9:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 9:5"/>Nake Petero akĩĩra Jesũ atĩrĩ, “Rabii,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rabii nĩ kuuga “mũrutani.”</char></note> nĩtwagĩrĩirwo nĩ gũikara gũkũ. Reke twake ithũnũ ithatũ, kĩmwe gĩaku, na kĩmwe kĩa Musa, na kĩmwe kĩa Elija.” <verse eid="MRK 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 9:6"/>(Petero oigire ũguo tondũ nĩarigĩtwo nĩ ũrĩa ekuuga, nĩ tondũ wa ũrĩa maamakĩte.)<verse eid="MRK 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 9:7"/>Ningĩ hagĩũka itu, rĩkĩmahumbĩra, na mũgambo ũkiuma itu-inĩ rĩu, ũkiuga atĩrĩ, “Ũyũ nĩwe Mũrũ wakwa, ũrĩa nyendete. Mũiguagei!”<verse eid="MRK 9:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 9:8"/>Na kahinda o kau makĩĩhũgũra, no mationire mũndũ ũngĩ arĩ hamwe nao, tiga o Jesũ.<verse eid="MRK 9:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 9:9"/>Na rĩrĩa maikũrũkaga kuuma kĩrĩma-inĩ, Jesũ akĩmaatha matikeere mũndũ o na ũrĩkũ ũrĩa monete, nginya rĩrĩa Mũrũ wa Mũndũ agaakorwo ariũkĩte akoima kũrĩ arĩa akuũ. <verse eid="MRK 9:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 9:10"/>Nao magĩkira na ũhoro ũcio, no makooranagia o ene atĩrĩ, “kũriũka kuuma kũrĩ akuũ nĩ kuuga atĩa.”<verse eid="MRK 9:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 9:11"/>Nao makĩmũũria atĩrĩ, “Nĩ kĩĩ gĩtũmaga arutani a watho moige atĩ Elija no nginya ambe ooke?”<verse eid="MRK 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 9:12"/>Jesũ akĩmacookeria atĩrĩ, “Ti-itherũ Elija no nginya ambe ooke ahaarĩrie maũndũ mothe. Ningĩ nĩ kĩĩ gĩgĩtũmĩte kwandĩkwo atĩ Mũrũ wa Mũndũ no nginya athĩĩnĩke mũno na aregwo nĩ andũ? <verse eid="MRK 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 9:13"/>No ngũmwĩra atĩrĩ, Elija nĩarĩkĩtie gũũka na andũ makamwĩka o ũrĩa wothe meendaga kũmwĩka, o ta ũrĩa ũhoro wake wandĩkĩtwo.”<verse eid="MRK 9:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kũhonio gwa Kamwana Kaarĩ na Ngoma Thũku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 9:14"/>Na rĩrĩa maakinyire harĩ arutwo arĩa angĩ, makĩona kĩrĩndĩ kĩnene kĩmarigiicĩirie, na arutani a watho magĩkararania nao. <verse eid="MRK 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 9:15"/>Na rĩrĩa andũ othe moonire Jesũ, makĩgega mũno magĩtengʼera makamũgeithie.<verse eid="MRK 9:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 9:16"/>Nake akĩmooria atĩrĩ, “Nĩ kĩĩ mũrakararanĩria nao?”<verse eid="MRK 9:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 9:17"/>Mũndũ ũmwe warĩ kĩrĩndĩ-inĩ kĩu akĩmũcookeria atĩrĩ, “Mũrutani, ngũkũreheire mũrũ wakwa, ũkoragwo arĩ na ngoma thũku na ndaaragia. <verse eid="MRK 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 9:18"/>Hĩndĩ ĩrĩa yothe yamũnyiita, ĩmũtungumanagia thĩ na akarutaga mũhũyũ na kanua, akahagarania magego na akomagara. Njũũririe arutwo aku maingate ngoma ĩyo thũku, no matinahota.”<verse eid="MRK 9:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 9:19"/>Jesũ akĩmacookeria atĩrĩ, “Inyuĩ rũciaro rũrũ rũtetĩkagia, nĩ nginya rĩ ngũikarania na inyuĩ? Ngũmũkirĩrĩria nginya rĩ? Ndeherai kamwana kau.”<verse eid="MRK 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 9:20"/>Nĩ ũndũ ũcio magĩgatwarĩra Jesũ. Rĩrĩa ngoma ĩyo thũku yoonire Jesũ, ĩgĩgathiorania o rĩmwe. Gagĩtungumana thĩ, gakĩgaragara, gakĩrutaga mũhũyũ na kanua.<verse eid="MRK 9:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 9:21"/>Nake Jesũ akĩũria ithe wa kamwana kau atĩrĩ, “Nĩ hĩndĩ ĩigana atĩa gakoretwo kahaana ũguo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:21">Nake agĩcookia atĩrĩ, “Nĩ kuuma arĩ o kaana. <verse eid="MRK 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 9:22"/>Na maita maingĩ yanagaikia mwaki-inĩ o na maaĩ-inĩ ĩkoorage. No akorwo nĩ harĩ ũndũ ũngĩka, tũiguĩre tha ũtũteithie.”<verse eid="MRK 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 9:23"/>Jesũ akĩmũũria atĩrĩ, “Atĩ ‘korwo ndahota’? Maũndũ mothe nĩmahotekaga kũrĩ mũndũ ũrĩa wĩtĩkĩtie.”<verse eid="MRK 9:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 9:24"/>O rĩmwe ithe wa kamwana kau akĩanĩrĩra, akiuga atĩrĩ, “Nĩndetĩkia, ndeithia harĩa njagĩte gwĩtĩkia.”<verse eid="MRK 9:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 9:25"/>Rĩrĩa Jesũ oonire atĩ kĩrĩndĩ nĩgĩatengʼerete gĩũke hau, agĩkũũma ngoma ĩyo thũku. Akĩmĩĩra atĩrĩ, “Wee ngoma ĩno thũku ũtaiguaga na ũtaaragia, nĩndagwatha uume thĩinĩ wa kamwana gaka, na ndũkanacooke gũtoonya thĩinĩ wako rĩngĩ.”<verse eid="MRK 9:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 9:26"/>Ngoma ĩyo thũku ĩgĩkayũrũrũka, ĩgĩgathiorania na hinya, na ĩkiuma. Kamwana kau gakĩhaana ta karĩ gakuũ, o nginya andũ aingĩ makiuga atĩrĩ, “Nĩ gakuũ.” <verse eid="MRK 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 9:27"/>No Jesũ agĩkanyiita guoko, agĩgokĩria, nako gakĩrũgama.<verse eid="MRK 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 9:28"/>Thuutha wa Jesũ gũtoonya nyũmba, arutwo ake makĩmũũrĩria keheri-inĩ atĩrĩ, “Nĩ kĩĩ gĩtũmire ithuĩ tũremwo nĩ kũingata ngoma ĩyo?”<verse eid="MRK 9:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 9:29"/>Nake akĩmacookeria atĩrĩ, “Ngoma ya mũthemba ta ũcio ndĩngiuma na njĩra ĩngĩ tiga o ya mahooya (o na kwĩima irio).” (Nĩ harĩ maandĩko mangĩ matakoragwo na ũhoro ũyũ wa kwĩima irio).<verse eid="MRK 9:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 9:30"/>Nao makiuma kũu magĩtuĩkanĩria bũrũri wa Galili, na Jesũ ndeendaga mũndũ o na ũrĩkũ amenye kũrĩa marĩ, <verse eid="MRK 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 9:31"/>tondũ nĩarutaga arutwo ake. Nake akĩmeera atĩrĩ, “Mũrũ wa Mũndũ nĩegũkunyanĩrwo aneanwo moko-inĩ ma andũ, nao nĩmakamũũraga, no thuutha wa mĩthenya ĩtatũ nĩakariũka.” <verse eid="MRK 9:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 9:32"/>No matiigana gũtaũkĩrwo nĩ ũrĩa oigaga, na magĩĩtigĩra kũmũũria ũhoro ũcio.<verse eid="MRK 9:32"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nũũ Mũnene kũrĩ arĩa Angĩ?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 9:33"/>Nao magĩkinya Kaperinaumu. Na rĩrĩa aarĩ nyũmba thĩinĩ akĩmooria atĩrĩ, “Mũgũkararanagĩria kĩĩ tũrĩ njĩra-inĩ?” <verse eid="MRK 9:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 9:34"/>No-o magĩkira tondũ marĩ njĩra-inĩ nĩmakararanagia makĩũranagia nũũ mũnene kũrĩ arĩa angĩ.<verse eid="MRK 9:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 9:35"/>Na aikara thĩ, Jesũ agĩĩta arutwo arĩa ikũmi na eerĩ akĩmeera atĩrĩ, “Ũrĩa wothe ũngĩenda gũtuĩka wa mbere, no nginya akorwo arĩ wa thuutha wa arĩa angĩ na atuĩke ndungata ya andũ othe.”<verse eid="MRK 9:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 9:36"/>Nake akĩrehe kaana agĩkarũgamia gatagatĩ kao. Na aarĩkia gũkaiyũkia moko-inĩ make, akĩmeera atĩrĩ, <verse eid="MRK 9:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 9:37"/>“Ũrĩa wothe ũngĩamũkĩra kaana kamwe ta gaka thĩinĩ wa rĩĩtwa rĩakwa, nĩ niĩ aamũkagĩra; na ũrĩa ũngĩnyamũkĩra niĩ to niĩ aamũkagĩra, no nĩamũkagĩra ũrĩa wandũmire.”<verse eid="MRK 9:37"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ũrĩa ũtarĩ Thũ Iitũ arĩ Mwena Witũ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 9:38"/>Johana akĩmwĩra atĩrĩ, “Mũrutani, nĩtũronire mũndũ akĩingata ndaimono thĩinĩ wa rĩĩtwa rĩaku tũramwĩra atige, tondũ ti ũmwe witũ.”<verse eid="MRK 9:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 9:39"/>Nake Jesũ akĩmeera atĩrĩ, “Mũtikamũgirie! Gũtirĩ mũndũ ũngĩringa kĩama thĩinĩ wa rĩĩtwa rĩakwa na thuutha ũcio ahote gũcooka kwaria ũũru wakwa, <verse eid="MRK 9:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 9:40"/>Nĩgũkorwo ũrĩa ũtarĩ ũthũ na ithuĩ nĩ ũmwe witũ. <verse eid="MRK 9:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 9:41"/>Ngũmwĩra atĩrĩ na ma, mũndũ o wothe ũrĩa ũkaamũhe gĩkombe kĩa maaĩ thĩinĩ wa rĩĩtwa rĩakwa nĩ ũndũ mũrĩ a Kristũ, ndarĩ hĩndĩ akoorwo nĩ igai rĩake.”<verse eid="MRK 9:41"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Gũtũma Mũndũ Eehie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 9:42"/>“Na mũndũ ũrĩa wothe ũgaatũma kamwe ga twana tũtũ tũnjĩtĩkĩtie kehie, wega nĩ mũndũ ũcio ohererwo ihiga rĩa gĩthĩi ngingo na aikio thĩinĩ wa iria. <verse eid="MRK 9:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 9:43"/>Guoko gwaku kũngĩtũma wĩhie, gũtinie. Nĩ kaba ũtoonye muoyo-inĩ wĩ kĩonje, <verse eid="MRK 9:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 9:44"/>gũkĩra ũthiĩ Jehanamu kũrĩa kũrĩ mwaki ũtahoraga ũrĩ na moko meerĩ. <verse eid="MRK 9:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 9:45"/>Nakuo kũgũrũ gwaku kũngĩtũma wĩhie, gũtinie. Nĩ kaba ũtoonye muoyo-inĩ ũrĩ gĩthua, gũkĩra ũikio Jehanamu ũrĩ na magũrũ meerĩ. <verse eid="MRK 9:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 9:46"/>Kũu kĩgunyũ kĩrĩa kĩmarĩĩaga gĩtikuaga, naguo mwaki ũrĩa ũmacinaga ndũhoraga. <verse eid="MRK 9:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 9:47"/>Na riitho rĩaku rĩngĩtũma wĩhie, rĩkũũre. Nĩ kaba ũtoonye ũthamaki-inĩ wa Ngai ũrĩ na riitho rĩmwe gũkĩra ũikio Jehanamu ũrĩ na maitho meerĩ, <verse eid="MRK 9:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 9:48"/>kũu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 9:48">“ ‘kĩgunyũ kĩrĩa kĩmarĩĩaga gĩtikuaga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 9:48">naguo mwaki ũrĩa ũmacinaga ndũhoraga.’<verse eid="MRK 9:48"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 9:49"/>Mũndũ o wothe agekĩrwo mũcamo wa cumbĩ nĩ mwaki, (na igongona o rĩothe rĩĩkĩrwo mũcamo na cumbĩ).<verse eid="MRK 9:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 9:50"/>“Cumbĩ nĩ mwega, no cumbĩ ũngĩkorwo nĩũthirĩte mũcamo waguo-rĩ, ũngĩcooka gũcamithio ta cumbĩ na kĩ? Tuĩkai cumbĩ, na mũikaranagie na thayũ.”<verse eid="MRK 9:50"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MRK 10"/>
  <para style="s1">Ndigano ya Mũthuuri na Mũtumia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 10:1"/>Jesũ agĩcooka akiuma kũu agĩthiĩ bũrũri wa Judea na mũrĩmo ũrĩa ũngĩ wa Jorodani. O rĩngĩ andũ ikundi magĩũka kũrĩ we, nake akĩmaruta ũhoro o ta ũrĩa aamenyerete gwĩka.<verse eid="MRK 10:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 10:2"/>Na Afarisai amwe magĩũka kũrĩ we makĩenda kũmũgeria, makĩmũũria atĩrĩ, “Watho nĩwĩtĩkĩrĩtie mũndũ atigane na mũtumia wake?”<verse eid="MRK 10:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 10:3"/>Nake agĩcookia ũhoro, akĩmooria atĩrĩ, “Musa aamwathire mwĩkage atĩa?”<verse eid="MRK 10:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 10:4"/>Nao makĩmwĩra atĩrĩ, “Musa nĩetĩkagĩria mũndũ aandĩkĩre mũtumia wake marũa ma gũtigana nake, amũte.”<verse eid="MRK 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 10:5"/>Jesũ akĩmacookeria atĩrĩ, “Musa aamwandĩkĩire watho ũcio tondũ wa ũrĩa muomĩtie ngoro cianyu. <verse eid="MRK 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 10:6"/>No kuuma o kĩambĩrĩria, Ngai ‘ombire mũndũ mũrũme na mũndũ-wa-nja’. <verse eid="MRK 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 10:7"/>‘Gĩkĩ nĩkĩo gĩtũmaga mũndũ mũrũme atige ithe na nyina na anyiitane na mũtumia wake, <verse eid="MRK 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 10:8"/>nao eerĩ magatuĩka mwĩrĩ ũmwe.’ Nĩ ũndũ ũcio, acio ti andũ eerĩ rĩngĩ, no nĩ mũndũ ũmwe. <verse eid="MRK 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 10:9"/>Nĩ ũndũ ũcio, arĩa Ngai anyiitithanĩtie, mũndũ ndakanamatigithanie.”<verse eid="MRK 10:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 10:10"/>Na maatoonya nyũmba thĩinĩ, arutwo makĩũria Jesũ ũhoro ũcio o rĩngĩ. <verse eid="MRK 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 10:11"/>Nake akĩmacookeria atĩrĩ, “Mũndũ o wothe angĩtigana na mũtumia wake acooke ahikie mũtumia ũngĩ, mũndũ ũcio nĩ atharĩtie. <verse eid="MRK 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 10:12"/>Nake mũtumia angĩtigana na mũthuuriwe, ahikĩre mũndũ mũrũme ũngĩ, o nake nĩ atharĩtie.”<verse eid="MRK 10:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Twana Tũnini na Jesũ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 10:13"/>Nao andũ makĩrehera Jesũ twana tũnini nĩguo atũhutie, no arutwo ake makĩmakaania. <verse eid="MRK 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 10:14"/>Rĩrĩa Jesũ oonire ũguo, akĩrakara, akĩmeera atĩrĩ, “Rekei twana tũu tũũke kũrĩ niĩ, tigai gũtũgiria, nĩgũkorwo ũthamaki wa Ngai nĩ wa arĩa matariĩ ta tuo. <verse eid="MRK 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 10:15"/>Ngũmwĩra atĩrĩ na ma, ũrĩa wothe ũtakamũkĩra ũthamaki wa Ngai ta kaana ndakaũtoonya o na atĩa.” <verse eid="MRK 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 10:16"/>Nake akĩoya twana tũu, agĩtũigĩrĩra moko, agĩtũrathima.<verse eid="MRK 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mwanake warĩ Gĩtonga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 10:17"/>Na rĩrĩa Jesũ oimagaraga, mũndũ ũmwe nĩatengʼerire harĩ we, agĩturia ndu mbere yake, akĩmũũria atĩrĩ, “Mũrutani mwega, ingĩĩka atĩa nĩguo ngaagaya muoyo wa tene na tene?”<verse eid="MRK 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 10:18"/>Nake Jesũ akĩmũũria atĩrĩ, “Ũkũnjĩta mwega nĩkĩ? Gũtirĩ o na ũmwe mwega, tiga o Ngai we wiki. <verse eid="MRK 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 10:19"/>Wee nĩ ũũĩ ũrĩa maathani moigĩte: ‘Ndũkanoragane, na ndũkanatharanie, na ndũkanaiye, na ndũkanaigĩrĩre mũndũ ũrĩa ũngĩ kĩgeenyo, na ndũkanaheenanie, na tĩĩa thoguo na nyũkwa.’ ”<verse eid="MRK 10:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 10:20"/>Nake akĩmwĩra atĩrĩ, “Mũrutani, macio mothe ndũire ndĩmarũmĩtie kuuma ndĩ mũnini.”<verse eid="MRK 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 10:21"/>Nake Jesũ amũrora, akĩmwenda, akĩmwĩra atĩrĩ, “Nĩ kũrĩ ũndũ ũmwe ũtigairie: Thiĩ wendie indo ciaku ciothe iria ũrĩ nacio ũhe athĩĩni mbeeca icio, na nĩũkagĩa na mũthithũ igũrũ. Ũcooke ũũke, ũnũmĩrĩre.”<verse eid="MRK 10:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 10:22"/>Mwanake ũcio agĩtukia gĩthiithi. Agĩthiĩ arĩ na kĩeha, tondũ aarĩ na ũtonga mũingĩ.<verse eid="MRK 10:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 10:23"/>Nake Jesũ akĩĩhũgũra, akĩĩra arutwo ake atĩrĩ, “Kaĩ nĩ ũndũ wĩ hinya gĩtonga gũtoonya ũthamaki-inĩ wa Ngai-ĩ!”<verse eid="MRK 10:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 10:24"/>Nao arutwo makĩgega maigua ciugo ciake. No Jesũ akiuga o rĩngĩ atĩrĩ, “Ciana, kaĩ nĩ ũndũ wĩ hinya gũtoonya ũthamaki-inĩ wa Ngai-ĩ! <verse eid="MRK 10:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 10:25"/>Nĩ ũhũthũ ngamĩĩra kũhungura irima rĩa cindano gũkĩra gĩtonga gũtoonya ũthamaki-inĩ wa Ngai.”<verse eid="MRK 10:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 10:26"/>Arutwo ake magĩkĩrĩrĩria kũgega, makĩũrania atĩrĩ, “Nũũ ũngĩkĩhonoka?”<verse eid="MRK 10:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 10:27"/>Nake Jesũ akĩmarora, akĩmeera atĩrĩ, “Harĩ mũndũ ũndũ ũyũ ndũngĩhoteka, no harĩ Ngai tiguo; maũndũ mothe nĩ mahotekaga nĩ Ngai.”<verse eid="MRK 10:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 10:28"/>Petero akĩmwĩra atĩrĩ, “Ithuĩ tũtigĩte maũndũ mothe tũgakũrũmĩrĩra!”<verse eid="MRK 10:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 10:29"/>Nake Jesũ akĩmũcookeria atĩrĩ, “Ngũmwĩra atĩrĩ na ma, gũtirĩ mũndũ ũtigĩte mũciĩ kana ariũ a nyina, kana aarĩ a nyina, kana nyina, kana ithe, kana ciana, o na kana ithaka nĩ ũndũ wakwa, na nĩ ũndũ wa Ũhoro-ũrĩa-Mwega, <verse eid="MRK 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 10:30"/>ũtakaheo ũtonga maita igana matukũ maya tũrĩ, na aheo maita igana ma nyũmba, na ariũ a nyina, na aarĩ a nyina, na manyina, na ciana o na ithaka, na hamwe na macio, mĩnyamaro. Na ihinda rĩrĩa rĩgooka aheo muoyo wa tene na tene. <verse eid="MRK 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 10:31"/>No rĩrĩ, andũ aingĩ arĩa marĩ mbere nĩmagatuĩka a thuutha, na a thuutha matuĩke a mbere.”<verse eid="MRK 10:31"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jesũ kwaria Rĩngĩ Ũhoro wa Gĩkuũ Gĩake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 10:32"/>Na rĩrĩa maarĩ njĩra-inĩ makĩambata merekeire Jerusalemu, Jesũ amatongoretie, arutwo ake nĩmagegire, nao arĩa maamarũmĩrĩire magĩĩtigĩra. O rĩngĩ Jesũ agĩtwara arutwo arĩa ikũmi na eerĩ keheri-inĩ, akĩambĩrĩria kũmeera maũndũ marĩa maakirie kũmũkora. <verse eid="MRK 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 10:33"/>Akĩmeera atĩrĩ, “Nĩtũkwambata tũthiĩ Jerusalemu, nake Mũrũ wa Mũndũ nĩegũkunyanĩrwo kũrĩ athĩnjĩri-Ngai arĩa anene na kũrĩ arutani a watho. Nao mamũtuĩre kũũragwo na mamũneane kũrĩ andũ-a-Ndũrĩrĩ, <verse eid="MRK 10:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 10:34"/>nao mamũnyũrũrie na mamũtuĩre mata, na mamũhũũre iboko o na mamũũrage. No thuutha wa mĩthenya ĩtatũ nĩakariũka.”<verse eid="MRK 10:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ihooya rĩa Jakubu na Johana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 10:35"/>Na rĩrĩ, Jakubu na Johana, ariũ a Zebedi, magĩũka kũrĩ Jesũ. Makĩmwĩra atĩrĩ, “Mũrutani, tũkwenda ũtwĩkĩre o ũrĩa tũgũkũhooya.”<verse eid="MRK 10:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 10:36"/>Nake akĩmooria atĩrĩ, “Mũkwenda ndĩmwĩkĩre atĩa?”<verse eid="MRK 10:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 10:37"/>Nao makĩmũcookeria atĩrĩ, “Ũtwĩtĩkĩrie tũgaikara ũmwe guoko-inĩ gwaku kwa ũrĩo na ũrĩa ũngĩ guoko-inĩ gwaku kwa ũmotho riiri-inĩ waku.”<verse eid="MRK 10:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 10:38"/>Jesũ akĩmacookeria atĩrĩ, “Mũtiũĩ kĩrĩa mũrahooya. Mwahota kũnyuĩra gĩkombe kĩrĩa niĩ ngũnyuĩra, kana mũbatithio na ũbatithio ũrĩa ngũbatithio naguo?”<verse eid="MRK 10:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 10:39"/>Nao magĩcookia atĩrĩ, “Ĩĩ no tũhote.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:39">Jesũ akĩmeera atĩrĩ, “Gĩkombe kĩrĩa ngũnyuĩra nĩ mũkaanyuĩra, o na mũbatithio na ũbatithio ũrĩa ngũbatithio naguo. <verse eid="MRK 10:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 10:40"/>No ha ũhoro wa gũikara guoko-inĩ gwakwa kwa ũrĩo kana kwa ũmotho ti niĩ heanaga. Itĩ icio ikaaheo arĩa mathondekeirwo cio.”<verse eid="MRK 10:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 10:41"/>Rĩrĩa arutwo acio angĩ ikũmi maiguire ũhoro ũcio, makĩrakarĩra Jakubu na Johana. <verse eid="MRK 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 10:42"/>Nake Jesũ akĩmeeta hamwe akĩmeera atĩrĩ, “Nĩ mũũĩ atĩ andũ arĩa matuuagwo aathani a andũ-a-Ndũrĩrĩ nĩmetũũgagĩria igũrũ rĩao, nao anene ao nĩmamaathaga. <verse eid="MRK 10:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 10:43"/>No rĩrĩ, inyuĩ mũtitariĩ ũguo. Handũ ha ũguo, ũrĩa wothe ũngĩenda gũtuĩka mũnene thĩinĩ wanyu no nginya atuĩke ndungata yanyu, <verse eid="MRK 10:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 10:44"/>nake ũrĩa wothe ũkwenda gũtuĩka wa mbere thĩinĩ wanyu, no nginya atuĩke ngombo ya andũ othe. <verse eid="MRK 10:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 10:45"/>Nĩgũkorwo o na Mũrũ wa Mũndũ ndookire gũtungatĩrwo, no ookire gũtungata na arute muoyo wake nĩguo arĩhe thogora wa gũkũũra andũ aingĩ.”<verse eid="MRK 10:45"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mũtumumu Baritimayo Kũhota Kuona</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 10:46"/>Nao magĩkinya Jeriko. Na rĩrĩa Jesũ na arutwo ake, hamwe na kĩrĩndĩ kĩnene moimaga itũũra-inĩ rĩu, mũndũ warĩ mũtumumu wetagwo Baritimayo (ũguo nĩ kuuga mũrũ wa Timayo), aikarĩte thĩ mũkĩra-inĩ wa njĩra akĩhooya thendi. <verse eid="MRK 10:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 10:47"/>Na rĩrĩa aiguire atĩ nĩ Jesũ wa Nazarethi, akĩambĩrĩria kwanĩrĩra akiugaga atĩrĩ, “Jesũ, Mũrũ wa Daudi, njiguĩra tha!”<verse eid="MRK 10:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 10:48"/>Andũ aingĩ makĩmũkaania, makĩmwĩra akire, nowe agĩkĩrĩrĩria kwanĩrĩra, akiugaga atĩrĩ, “Mũrũ wa Daudi, njiguĩra tha!”<verse eid="MRK 10:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 10:49"/>Nake Jesũ akĩrũgama, akiuga atĩrĩ, “Mwĩtei.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:49">Nĩ ũndũ ũcio magĩĩta mũndũ ũcio warĩ mũtumumu, makĩmwĩra atĩrĩ, “Wĩyũmĩrĩrie! Rũgama! Nĩaragwĩta.” <verse eid="MRK 10:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 10:50"/>Agĩteania nguo yake ya igũrũ, agĩũkĩra na ihenya agĩthiĩ harĩ Jesũ.<verse eid="MRK 10:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 10:51"/>Jesũ akĩmũũria atĩrĩ, “Ũkwenda ngwĩkĩre atĩa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:51">Nake mũndũ ũcio warĩ mũtumumu akĩmũcookeria atĩrĩ, “Mũrutani, ngwenda o njooke kuona.”<verse eid="MRK 10:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 10:52"/>Nake Jesũ akĩmwĩra atĩrĩ, “Wĩthiĩre, wĩtĩkio waku nĩguo watũma ũhone.” O rĩmwe akĩambĩrĩria kuona, nake akĩrũmĩrĩra Jesũ.<verse eid="MRK 10:52"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MRK 11"/>
  <para style="s1">Jesũ Gũtoonya Jerusalemu na Ũhootani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 11:1"/>Na rĩrĩ, maakuhĩrĩria itũũra rĩa Jerusalemu, maakinya matũũra ma Bethifage na Bethania hau Kĩrĩma-inĩ kĩa Mĩtamaiyũ-rĩ, Jesũ agĩtũma arutwo ake eerĩ, <verse eid="MRK 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 11:2"/>akĩmeera atĩrĩ, “Thiĩi itũũra rĩĩrĩa rĩrĩ mbere yanyu, na mwatoonya o ũguo, nĩmũkuona njaũ ya ndigiri yohetwo hau, nayo ndĩrĩ yakuua mũndũ. Mĩohorei mũmĩrehe. <verse eid="MRK 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 11:3"/>Na mũngĩũrio nĩ mũndũ atĩrĩ, ‘Mũreka ũguo nĩkĩ?’ Mwĩrei atĩrĩ, ‘Mwathani nĩabatarĩtio nĩyo na nĩekũmĩcookia haha o narua.’ ”<verse eid="MRK 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 11:4"/>Nao magĩthiĩ magĩkora njaũ ya ndigiri yohetwo mũromo-inĩ handũ nja, hakuhĩ na njĩra. Na rĩrĩa maamĩohoraga-rĩ, <verse eid="MRK 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 11:5"/>andũ arĩa maarũngiĩ ho makĩmooria atĩrĩ, “Mũrohora njaũ ĩyo nĩkĩ?” <verse eid="MRK 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 11:6"/>Nao makĩmacookeria o ũrĩa Jesũ aamerĩte, nao andũ acio makĩmetĩkĩria mathiĩ nayo. <verse eid="MRK 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 11:7"/>Rĩrĩa maatwarĩire Jesũ njaũ ĩyo, makĩmĩtandĩka nguo ciao nake Jesũ agĩkuuo nĩyo. <verse eid="MRK 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 11:8"/>Andũ aingĩ makĩara nguo ciao njĩra-inĩ, nao arĩa angĩ makĩara mathĩgĩ marĩa maatuĩte mĩgũnda-inĩ. <verse eid="MRK 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 11:9"/>Andũ arĩa maatongoretie na arĩa maamumĩte thuutha makĩanĩrĩra makiuga atĩrĩ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 11:9">“Hosana!”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hosana nĩ kuuga “honokia rĩu”, na no kĩo kiugo gĩa kũgaatha mũthamaki.</char></note></para>
  <para style="b" vid="MRK 11:9"/>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 11:9">“Kũrathimwo-rĩ, nĩ ũrĩa ũgũũka na rĩĩtwa rĩa Mwathani!”<verse eid="MRK 11:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 11:10"/>“Kũrathimwo-rĩ, nĩ ũthamaki ũrĩa ũgũũka, ũrĩa wa ithe witũ Daudi!”</para>
  <para style="b" vid="MRK 11:10"/>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 11:10">“Hosana igũrũ o igũrũ!”<verse eid="MRK 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 11:11"/>Nake Jesũ aatoonya Jerusalemu, agĩthiĩ hekarũ-inĩ. Na aarĩkia kwĩrorangĩra maũndũ mothe, akiumagara agĩthiĩ Bethania hamwe na arutwo arĩa ikũmi na eerĩ, tondũ kwarĩ hwaĩ-inĩ.<verse eid="MRK 11:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jesũ Kũruma Mũkũyũ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 11:12"/>Mũthenya ũyũ ũngĩ rĩrĩa moimaga Bethania, Jesũ akĩigua ahũtiĩ. <verse eid="MRK 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 11:13"/>Nake akĩona mũkũyũ warĩ haraaya ũrĩ na mathangũ maruru agĩthiĩ kũrora kana warĩ na ngũyũ. Aakinya harĩ guo, agĩkora ndwarĩ na ngũyũ tiga o mathangũ, tondũ ndĩarĩ hĩndĩ ya mĩkũyũ gũciara. <verse eid="MRK 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 11:14"/>Nake akĩĩra mũkũyũ ũcio atĩrĩ, “Mũndũ ndakanarĩe maciaro maku nginya tene.” Nao arutwo ake makĩigua akiuga ũguo.<verse eid="MRK 11:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jesũ Gũtheria Hekarũ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 11:15"/>Na maakinya Jerusalemu, Jesũ agĩtoonya hekarũ thĩinĩ,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nĩ mwena wa hekarũ kũrĩa andũ-a-Ndũrĩrĩ metĩkĩrĩtio kũhoera Ngai.</char></note> akĩambĩrĩria kũrutũrũra arĩa maagũraga, na arĩa meendanagĩria kuo. Akĩngʼaũrania metha cia arĩa maakũũranagia mbeeca, o na itĩ cia arĩa meendagia ndutura, <verse eid="MRK 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 11:16"/>na ndangĩetĩkĩririe mũndũ o na ũrĩkũ ahĩtũkĩrie kĩndũ gĩa kwendia kũu nja cia hekarũ.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Andũ maatuĩte nja ya hekarũ ta njĩra ya kũhĩtũkĩria indo cia kwendia.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 11:17"/>Na rĩrĩa aamarutaga, akĩmooria atĩrĩ, “Githĩ ũhoro ndwandĩkĩtwo atĩrĩ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 11:17">“ ‘Nyũmba yakwa ĩgeetagwo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 11:17">nyũmba ya mahooya ya kũhooyagĩrwo nĩ ndũrĩrĩ ciothe’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Andũ a Ndũrĩrĩ arĩa meetigĩrĩte Ngai nĩmerirwo nĩ Ngai atĩ nĩmũkahooyagĩra thĩinĩ wa hekarũ yake (Isa 56:7). Handũ hau nĩho Ayahudi maatuĩte ndũnyũ.</char></note>?</para>
  <para style="m" vid="MRK 11:17">No inyuĩ mũmĩtuĩte ‘ngurunga ya atunyani’.”<verse eid="MRK 11:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 11:18"/>Nao athĩnjĩri-Ngai arĩa anene na arutani a watho maigua ũguo, makĩambĩrĩria gũcaria ũrĩa mangĩmũũraga, nĩ ũndũ nĩmamwĩtigagĩra, tondũ kĩrĩndĩ gĩothe nĩkĩagegetio nĩ ũrutani wake.<verse eid="MRK 11:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 11:19"/>Gwakinya hwaĩ-inĩ, Jesũ na arutwo ake makiuma itũũra rĩu.<verse eid="MRK 11:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mũkũyũ kũũma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 11:20"/>Rũciinĩ, makĩhĩtũka makĩona mũkũyũ ũrĩa Jesũ aarumĩĩte ũũmĩte wothe nginya mĩri. <verse eid="MRK 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 11:21"/>Petero akĩririkana ũhoro wa mũkũyũ ũcio, akĩĩra Jesũ atĩrĩ, “Rabii, ta rora! Mũkũyũ ũrĩa ũrarumire-rĩ, nĩũũmĩte!”<verse eid="MRK 11:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 11:22"/>Nake Jesũ akĩmacookeria, akĩmeera atĩrĩ, “Ĩtĩkiai Ngai. <verse eid="MRK 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 11:23"/>Ngũmwĩra atĩrĩ na ma, mũndũ angĩkeera kĩrĩma gĩkĩ atĩrĩ, ‘Thiĩ, wĩikie iria-inĩ,’ na ndagathanganie ngoro-inĩ yake, no etĩkie atĩ ũrĩa oiga nĩũgwĩkĩka-rĩ, nĩagekĩrwo ũndũ ũcio. <verse eid="MRK 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 11:24"/>Nĩ ũndũ ũcio ngũmwĩra atĩrĩ, ũrĩa wothe mũrĩhooyaga mũheo, ĩtĩkagiai atĩ nĩ mũrĩkĩtie kũwamũkĩra, naguo nĩũrĩtuĩkaga wanyu. <verse eid="MRK 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 11:25"/>Na rĩrĩa mwarũgama mũhooe, mũrekanagĩre angĩkorwo mũrĩ ũthũ na mũndũ, nĩgeetha Ithe wanyu ũrĩa ũrĩ igũrũ o nake amũrekagĩre mehia manyu.” (<verse eid="MRK 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 11:26"/>No mũngĩkorwo mũtirekanagĩra mehia, nake Ithe wanyu ũrĩa ũrĩ igũrũ ndarĩmũrekagĩra mehia manyu.)<verse eid="MRK 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kĩũria Gĩkoniĩ Ũhoti wa Jesũ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 11:27"/>Magĩkinya o rĩngĩ Jerusalemu, na rĩrĩa Jesũ aaceeraga kũu nja cia hekarũ, athĩnjĩri-Ngai arĩa anene, na arutani a watho, o na athuuri magĩũka kũrĩ we. <verse eid="MRK 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 11:28"/>Makĩmũũria atĩrĩ, “Wĩkaga maũndũ maya na ũhoti ũrĩkũ? Na nũũ wakũheire ũhoti wa gwĩka maũndũ maya?”<verse eid="MRK 11:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 11:29"/>Nake Jesũ akĩmacookeria atĩrĩ, “Nĩngũmũũria kĩũria kĩmwe. Mwanjookeria, na niĩ nĩngũmwĩra njĩkaga maũndũ maya na ũhoti ũrĩkũ. <verse eid="MRK 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 11:30"/>Ũbatithio wa Johana-rĩ, woimire igũrũ kana kũrĩ andũ? Njookeriai!”<verse eid="MRK 11:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 11:31"/>Makĩaranĩria o ene ũhoro ũcio, makĩĩrana atĩrĩ, “Tũngiuga atĩ, ‘Woimire igũrũ’, egũtũũria atĩrĩ, ‘Mwakĩregire kũmwĩtĩkia nĩkĩ?’ <verse eid="MRK 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 11:32"/>No tũngiuga atĩrĩ, ‘Woimire kũrĩ andũ’ … .” (Nĩmetigagĩra andũ, tondũ andũ othe mooĩ kũna atĩ Johana aarĩ mũnabii.)<verse eid="MRK 11:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 11:33"/>Nĩ ũndũ ũcio magĩcookeria Jesũ atĩrĩ, “Ithuĩ tũtiũĩ.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 11:33">Nake Jesũ akĩmeera atĩrĩ, “O na niĩ ndikũmwĩra njĩkaga maũndũ maya na ũhoti ũrĩkũ.”<verse eid="MRK 11:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MRK 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Ngerekano ya Akombori a Mũgũnda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 12:1"/>Nake akĩambĩrĩria kũmahe ũhoro na ngerekano, akĩmeera atĩrĩ, “Mũndũ ũmwe nĩahaandire mũgũnda wake mĩthabibũ. Agĩaka rũgiri rũgĩthiũrũrũkĩria mũgũnda ũcio, na akĩenja irima rĩa kũhihĩra thabibũ, na agĩaka nyũmba ndaaya na igũrũ ya arangĩri. Agĩcooka agĩkomborithia mũgũnda ũcio kũrĩ arĩmi angĩ, na agĩthiĩ rũgendo. <verse eid="MRK 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 12:2"/>Na rĩrĩ, hĩndĩ ya magetha yakinya-rĩ, agĩtũma ndungata yake kũrĩ akombori acio ĩgĩĩre maciaro mamwe ma mũgũnda ũcio wa mĩthabibũ. <verse eid="MRK 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 12:3"/>Nao makĩmĩnyiita makĩmĩhũũra, na makĩmĩingata ĩtarĩ na kĩndũ. <verse eid="MRK 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 12:4"/>Agĩcooka akĩmatũmĩra ndungata ĩngĩ; nao magĩtiihia ndungata ĩyo mũtwe na makĩmĩĩka maũndũ ma thoni. <verse eid="MRK 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 12:5"/>Na o rĩngĩ agĩtũma ndungata ĩngĩ, nayo makĩmĩũraga. Nĩatũmire ndungata ingĩ nyingĩ, imwe ciacio magĩcihũũra, na iria ingĩ magĩciũraga.<verse eid="MRK 12:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 12:6"/>“Mũndũ ũcio ndaarĩ na mũndũ ũngĩ watigaire wa gũtũma, tiga o mũriũ wake ũrĩa eendete mũno. Akĩmũtũma thuutha wa acio angĩ othe, akiuga atĩrĩ, ‘Nĩmegũtĩĩa mũrũ wakwa.’<verse eid="MRK 12:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 12:7"/>“No akombori acio makĩĩrana atĩrĩ, ‘Ũyũ nĩwe ũkaagaya mũgũnda ũyũ. Ũkai, rekei tũmũũrage, nĩguo igai rĩake rĩgaatuĩka riitũ.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 12:8"/>Nĩ ũndũ ũcio makĩmũnyiita, makĩmũũraga, makĩmũikia nja ya mũgũnda ũcio wa mĩthabibũ.<verse eid="MRK 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 12:9"/>“Rĩu-rĩ, mwene mũgũnda ũcio ageeka atĩa? Agooka oorage akombori acio, acooke ahe andũ angĩ mũgũnda ũcio. <verse eid="MRK 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 12:10"/>Kaĩ mũtarĩ mwathoma maandĩko maya:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:10">“ ‘Ihiga rĩrĩa aaki maaregire,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:10">nĩrĩo rĩtuĩkĩte ihiga inene rĩa koine;<verse eid="MRK 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 12:11"/>Mwathani nĩwe wĩkĩte ũndũ ũcio,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:11">naguo nĩ wa magegania tũkĩwona’?”<verse eid="MRK 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 12:12"/>Magĩcaria ũrĩa mangĩmũnyiita tondũ nĩmamenyire aaragia ũhoro wao na ngerekano ĩyo, no nĩmetigagĩra kĩrĩndĩ; nĩ ũndũ ũcio magĩtigana nake, magĩthiĩ.<verse eid="MRK 12:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kũrĩha Igooti kũrĩ Kaisari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 12:13"/>Thuutha ũcio magĩtũma Afarisai amwe na Aherodia kũrĩ Jesũ nĩguo mamũtege na mĩario yake. <verse eid="MRK 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 12:14"/>Magĩũka kũrĩ we makĩmwĩra atĩrĩ, “Mũrutani, nĩtũũĩ atĩ ũrĩ mũndũ wa ma. Ndwĩtigagĩra andũ, tondũ ndũrũmbũyagia ũrĩa mahaana; no ũrutanaga ũhoro wa Ngai na ma. Rĩu-rĩ, nĩ kwagĩrĩire kũrutĩra Kaisari mbeeca cia igooti, kana aca?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Andũ nĩmaarutaga mbeeca cia igooti kũrĩ bũrũri ũrĩa wamathaga. Ayahudi matiakenagio nĩ ũhoro ũcio, na angĩ nĩmaregaga kũrĩruta.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 12:15"/>Tũrutage kana tũtikarutage?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:15">No tondũ Jesũ nĩamenyaga ũhinga wao, akĩmooria atĩrĩ, “Mũrenda kũngeria nĩkĩ? Ta ndeherai dinari ndĩmĩone.” <verse eid="MRK 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 12:16"/>Makĩmũrehera dinari ĩyo, nake akĩmooria atĩrĩ, “Mbica ĩno na rĩĩtwa rĩĩrĩ nĩ cia ũ?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:16">Nao makĩmũcookeria atĩrĩ, “Nĩ cia Kaisari.”<verse eid="MRK 12:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 12:17"/>Nake Jesũ akĩmeera atĩrĩ, “Rutagĩrai Kaisari kĩrĩa kĩrĩ gĩake, na mũrutagĩre Ngai kĩrĩa kĩrĩ gĩake.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:17">Nao makĩgegio nĩwe.<verse eid="MRK 12:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ũhiki Hĩndĩ ya Kũriũka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 12:18"/>Ningĩ Asadukai, arĩa moigaga atĩ gũtirĩ ũhoro wa kũriũka magĩũka kũrĩ Jesũ na makĩmũũria atĩrĩ, <verse eid="MRK 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 12:19"/>“Mũrutani, Musa aatwandĩkĩire atĩ mũrũ wa nyina na mũndũ angĩkua atige mũtumia atarĩ na ciana-rĩ, mũndũ ũcio no nginya ahikie mũtumia ũcio watigwo, aciarĩre mũrũ wa nyina ciana. <verse eid="MRK 12:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 12:20"/>Na rĩrĩ, kwarĩ aanake mũgwanja a nyina ũmwe. Wa mbere akĩhikania na agĩkua, na ndatige ciana. <verse eid="MRK 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 12:21"/>Nake wa keerĩ akĩhikia mũtumia ũcio wa ndigwa, no o nake agĩkua na ndatige ciana. O na wa gatatũ nake agĩĩka o ũguo. <verse eid="MRK 12:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 12:22"/>Ũhoro wa ma nĩ atĩ, gũtirĩ o na ũmwe wa acio mũgwanja watigire ciana. Thuutha wao othe, mũtumia ũcio o nake agĩkua. <verse eid="MRK 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 12:23"/>Rĩu-rĩ, hĩndĩ ya kũriũka mũtumia ũcio agaakorwo arĩ wa ũ, nĩgũkorwo othe mũgwanja nĩmamũhikĩtie?”<verse eid="MRK 12:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 12:24"/>Nake Jesũ akĩmacookeria atĩrĩ, “Nĩmũhĩtĩtie tondũ mũtiũĩ Maandĩko kana hinya wa Ngai? <verse eid="MRK 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 12:25"/>Rĩrĩa akuũ makaariũka, matikahikania kana mahike; magaatuĩka ta araika arĩa marĩ kũu igũrũ. <verse eid="MRK 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 12:26"/>Naguo ha ũhoro wa akuũ kũriũka-rĩ, kaĩ mũtathomete ibuku-inĩ rĩa Musa, ũhoro ũkoniĩ kĩhinga kĩrĩa kĩahĩaga, na ũrĩa Ngai aamwĩrire atĩrĩ, ‘Niĩ nĩ niĩ Ngai wa Iburahĩmu na Ngai wa Isaaka, o na Ngai wa Jakubu?’ <verse eid="MRK 12:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 12:27"/>We ti Ngai wa arĩa akuũ, no nĩ wa arĩa marĩ muoyo. Inyuĩ mũhĩtĩtie mũno.”<verse eid="MRK 12:27"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Rĩathani rĩrĩa Inene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 12:28"/>Na rĩrĩ, mũrutani ũmwe wa watho nĩokire akĩigua makĩaria. Aamenya atĩ Jesũ nĩamacookeirie icookio rĩega-rĩ, akĩmũũria atĩrĩ, “Harĩ maathani marĩa mangĩ mothe-rĩ, nĩ rĩrĩkũ rĩa bata mũno?”<verse eid="MRK 12:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 12:29"/>Jesũ agĩcookia atĩrĩ, “Rĩathani rĩrĩa rĩa bata mũno nĩ rĩĩrĩ: ‘Thikĩrĩria, inyuĩ Isiraeli, Mwathani Ngai witũ, Mwathani nĩ ũmwe. <verse eid="MRK 12:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 12:30"/>Endaga Mwathani Ngai waku na ngoro yaku yothe, na muoyo waku wothe, na meciiria maku mothe, na hinya waku wothe.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 12:31"/>Narĩo rĩa keerĩ nĩ rĩrĩ: ‘Endaga mũndũ ũrĩa ũngĩ o ta ũrĩa wĩendete wee mwene.’ Gũtirĩ rĩathani rĩngĩ inene kũrĩ macio.”<verse eid="MRK 12:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 12:32"/>Nake mũndũ ũcio agĩcookia atĩrĩ, “Mũrutani, ti-itherũ nĩwoiga wega atĩ Ngai nĩ ũmwe na gũtirĩ ũngĩ tiga we! <verse eid="MRK 12:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 12:33"/>Ningĩ ũmwende na ngoro yaku yothe, o na ũmenyo waku wothe, o na hinya waku wothe; o nakuo kwenda mũndũ ũrĩa ũngĩ o ta ũrĩa wĩendete wee mwene, ũcio nĩ ũndũ ũrĩ bata gũkĩra maruta mothe ma njino na magongona.”<verse eid="MRK 12:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 12:34"/>Rĩrĩa Jesũ oonire nĩacookia wega, akĩmwĩra atĩrĩ, “Wee-rĩ, ndũrĩ haraaya na ũthamaki wa Ngai.” Na kuuma hĩndĩ ĩyo gũtirĩ mũndũ wacookire kũũmĩrĩria kũmũũria ciũria ingĩ.<verse eid="MRK 12:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kristũ nĩ Mũriũ Wa ũ?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 12:35"/>Na rĩrĩ, Jesũ akĩrutana nja-inĩ cia hekarũ akĩmooria atĩrĩ, “Nĩ kĩĩ gĩtũmaga arutani a watho moige atĩ Kristũ nĩ mũrũ wa Daudi? <verse eid="MRK 12:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 12:36"/>Daudi we mwene, akĩaria arĩ na Roho Mũtheru, oigire atĩrĩ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">“ ‘Mwathani eerire Mwathani wakwa atĩrĩ:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:36">“ikara guoko-inĩ gwakwa kwa ũrĩo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">nginya ngaiga thũ ciaku</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:36">rungu rwa makinya maku.” ’<verse eid="MRK 12:36"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 12:37"/>Daudi we mwene aramwĩta ‘Mwathani.’ Angĩgĩtuĩka mũrũwe atĩa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:37">Na nĩ haarĩ na gĩkundi kĩnene kĩa andũ kĩamũthikagĩrĩria gĩkenete.<verse eid="MRK 12:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 12:38"/>Ningĩ Jesũ akĩrutana, akiuga atĩrĩ, “Mwĩmenyagĩrĩrei arutani a watho. Mendete gũthiĩ mehumbĩte nguo iria ndaaya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:38 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Arutani a watho mekagĩra kanjũ ndaihu mũno hakuhĩ kũhutia thĩ.</char></note> na kũgeithagio nĩ andũ othe rĩrĩa mekũgera ndũnyũ-inĩ, <verse eid="MRK 12:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 12:39"/>na makenda gũikaragĩra itĩ iria cia bata thunagogi-inĩ, na gũikara handũ ha andũ arĩa atĩĩku maruga-inĩ. <verse eid="MRK 12:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 12:40"/>Na no-o matoonyagĩrĩra nyũmba cia atumia a ndigwa makamatunya indo ciao, na nĩguo meyonanie, makahooya mahooya maraihu. Andũ ta acio nĩ makaaherithio mũno makĩria.”<verse eid="MRK 12:40"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Iruta rĩa Mũtumia wa Ndigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 12:41"/>Jesũ agĩikara thĩ angʼetheire harĩa heekagĩrwo maruta,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:41 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ithandũkũ rĩa mũhothi rĩaigagwo kũrĩa andũ-a-nja maahooyagĩra; arũme matiagiragio gũtoonya kuo.</char></note> akĩĩrorera ũrĩa gĩkundi kĩu kĩahothaga. Andũ aingĩ itonga makĩhotha mbeeca nyingĩ. <verse eid="MRK 12:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 12:42"/>No mũtumia ũmwe wa ndigwa warĩ mũthĩĩni agĩũka akĩhotha tũthendi twĩrĩ tũnini mũno twa gĩcango tũrĩa twarĩ mũigana wa mbeeca ĩmwe.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:42 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gaka nĩko gathendi karĩa kaarĩ kanini mũno thĩinĩ wa Palestina hĩndĩ ĩyo. Mũtumia ũyũ wa ndigwa aarehire tũthendi twĩrĩ, na no tuo aarĩ natuo.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 12:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 12:43"/>Jesũ agĩĩta arutwo ake harĩ we, akĩmeera atĩrĩ, “Ngũmwĩra atĩrĩ na ma, mũtumia ũyũ wa ndigwa mũthĩĩni nĩekĩra mbeeca nyingĩ kĩgĩĩna-inĩ gũkĩra andũ arĩa angĩ othe. <verse eid="MRK 12:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 12:44"/>Acio angĩ othe maheana kũringana na ũingĩ wa ũtonga wao, no mũtumia ũyũ aheana kĩrĩa gĩothe oima nakĩo, o na arĩ mũthĩĩni-rĩ, aheana mũthithũ wake wothe.”<verse eid="MRK 12:44"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MRK 13"/>
  <para style="s1">Imenyithia cia Hĩndĩ ya Mũthia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 13:1"/>Na rĩrĩa Jesũ oimaga hekarũ-inĩ, ũmwe wa arutwo ake akĩmwĩra atĩrĩ, “Mũrutani, ta rora! Mahiga maya kaĩ nĩ manene-ĩ!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Maandĩko ma tene moigaga mahiga ma hekarũ ĩyo maarĩ manene mũno; mamwe maarĩ na ũraihu wa buti mĩrongo ĩtatũ na mũgwanja (37), wariĩ wa buti ikũmi na inyanya (18), na buti ikũmi na igĩrĩ (12) kũraiha na igũrũ.</char></note> Kaĩ nyũmba ici nĩ thaka-ĩ!”<verse eid="MRK 13:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 13:2"/>Nake Jesũ akĩmũcookeria atĩrĩ, “Nĩũrona nyũmba ici nene ũũ? Gũtirĩ ihiga o na rĩmwe rĩa maya rĩgaakorwo rĩrĩ igũrũ wa rĩrĩa rĩngĩ; mothe nĩmakamomorwo.”<verse eid="MRK 13:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 13:3"/>Rĩrĩa Jesũ aikarĩte thĩ kĩrĩma-inĩ kĩa Mĩtamaiyũ angʼetheire hekarũ-rĩ, Petero na Jakubu na Johana na Anderea makĩmũũria marĩ keheri-inĩ atĩrĩ, <verse eid="MRK 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 13:4"/>“Ta twĩre, maũndũ macio mageekĩka rĩ? Na kĩmenyithia atĩ maũndũ macio marĩ hakuhĩ gwĩkĩka nĩ kĩrĩkũ?”<verse eid="MRK 13:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 13:5"/>Nake Jesũ akĩmeera atĩrĩ, “Mwĩmenyagĩrĩrei mũtikanaheenio nĩ mũndũ o na ũrĩkũ. <verse eid="MRK 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 13:6"/>Andũ aingĩ nĩ magooka na rĩĩtwa rĩakwa makiugaga atĩrĩ, ‘Niĩ nĩ niĩ Kristũ,’ na nĩmakaheenia andũ aingĩ. <verse eid="MRK 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 13:7"/>Rĩrĩa mũkaigua mbaara na mũhuhu wa mbaara mũtikanamake. Maũndũ ta macio no nginya mekĩke, no rĩrĩ, ithirĩro ti rĩkinyu. <verse eid="MRK 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 13:8"/>Rũrĩrĩ nĩrũgookĩrĩra rũrĩa rũngĩ, na ũthamaki ũũkĩrĩre ũthamaki ũrĩa ũngĩ. Nĩgũkaagĩa na ithingithia kũndũ na kũndũ, o na kũgĩe ngʼaragu. Maũndũ maya nĩ kĩambĩrĩria kĩa ruo ta rwa mũndũ-wa-nja akĩrũmwo.<verse eid="MRK 13:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 13:9"/>“No inyuĩ-rĩ, ikaragai mwĩiguĩte. Nĩmũkaneanwo kũrĩ ciama cia athuuri na mũhũũrwo iboko thĩinĩ wa thunagogi. Nĩmũkarũgama mbere ya aathani na athamaki nĩ ũndũ wakwa, mũtuĩke aira akwa kũrĩ o. <verse eid="MRK 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 13:10"/>Naguo Ũhoro-ũrĩa-Mwega no nginya wambe ũhunjio kũrĩ ndũrĩrĩ ciothe. <verse eid="MRK 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 13:11"/>Rĩrĩa rĩothe mũkaanyiitwo mũtwarwo mũgaciirithio, mũtikanetange mũgĩĩciiria ũrĩa mũkoiga. Inyuĩ mũkoiga o ũrĩa mũkaahotithio hĩndĩ ĩyo, nĩgũkorwo ti inyuĩ mũgaakorwo mũkĩaria, no nĩ Roho mũtheru.<verse eid="MRK 13:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 13:12"/>“Mũndũ nĩagakunyanĩra mũrũ wa nyina ooragwo, na ithe wa mũndũ akunyanĩre mwana wake, o na ciana nĩikaremera aciari a cio na imoragithie. <verse eid="MRK 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 13:13"/>Andũ othe nĩmakamũmena nĩ ũndũ wakwa, no ũrĩa ũgaakirĩrĩria nginya hĩndĩ ya mũthia nĩakahonoka.<verse eid="MRK 13:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 13:14"/>“Rĩrĩa mũkoona kĩrĩa kĩrĩ thaahu na gĩa kũrehe ihooru kĩarũgama harĩa gĩtagĩrĩirwo nĩ kũrũgama-rĩ, (ũrĩa ũrathoma nĩamenye ũhoro ũcio), hĩndĩ ĩyo arĩa marĩ Judea nĩmoorĩre irĩma-inĩ. <verse eid="MRK 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 13:15"/>Mũndũ ũrĩa wothe ũgaakorwo arĩ nyũmba yake igũrũ ndakanaharũrũke kana atoonye kũruta kĩndũ nyũmba. <verse eid="MRK 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 13:16"/>Nake mũndũ ũrĩa ũgaakorwo arĩ mũgũnda ndagacooke mũciĩ kũgĩĩra nguo ciake. <verse eid="MRK 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 13:17"/>Kaĩ atumia arĩa magaakorwo marĩ na nda na arĩa magaakorwo makĩongithia hĩndĩ ĩyo nĩmagakorwo marĩ na haaro-ĩ! <verse eid="MRK 13:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 13:18"/>Hooyagai Ngai atĩ maũndũ macio matikanakinye hĩndĩ ya heho, <verse eid="MRK 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 13:19"/>nĩ ũndũ matukũ macio gũgaakorwo na mĩnyamaro ĩtarĩ yoneka ĩngĩ tayo kuuma kĩambĩrĩria rĩrĩa Ngai ombire thĩ nginya rĩu, na gũtikoneka ĩngĩ tayo. <verse eid="MRK 13:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 13:20"/>Tiga Mwathani anyihanyiihirie matukũ macio, gũtirĩ mũndũ ũngĩgatigara. No tondũ wa andũ ake arĩa aamũre, matukũ macio nĩmagakuhĩhio. <verse eid="MRK 13:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 13:21"/>Hĩndĩ ĩyo mũndũ o na ũrĩkũ angĩkamwĩra atĩrĩ, ‘Kristũ arĩ haha!’ kana amwĩre atĩrĩ, ‘Kristũ arĩ haarĩa!’ mũtikanetĩkie ũhoro ũcio. <verse eid="MRK 13:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 13:22"/>Nĩgũkorwo Kristũ a maheeni na anabii a maheeni nĩmakeyumĩria monanie morirũ na maringe ciama nĩguo mahĩtithie andũ arĩa aamũre, korwo no kũhoteke. <verse eid="MRK 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 13:23"/>Nĩ ũndũ ũcio-rĩ, ikaragai mwĩiguĩte tondũ nĩndamwĩra maũndũ mothe mbere ya ihinda rĩtanakinya.<verse eid="MRK 13:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 13:24"/>“No ihinda-inĩ rĩu, thuutha wa maũndũ macio ma mĩnyamaro,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 13:24">“ ‘riũa nĩrĩkagĩa nduma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 13:24">naguo mweri ndũkaara;<verse eid="MRK 13:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 13:25"/>njata nacio nĩikaagũa kuuma igũrũ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 13:25">namo maahinya ma igũrũ nĩmakenyenyio.’<verse eid="MRK 13:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 13:26"/>“Hĩndĩ ĩyo andũ nĩ makoona Mũrũ wa Mũndũ agĩũka arĩ thĩinĩ wa matu, arĩ na hinya mũingĩ mũno o na riiri. <verse eid="MRK 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 13:27"/>Nake nĩagatũma araika ake macookanĩrĩrie andũ ake arĩa aamũre kuuma mĩena ĩna ĩrĩa yumaga rũhuho, o na kuuma ituri ciothe cia thĩ na cia igũrũ.<verse eid="MRK 13:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 13:28"/>“Na rĩrĩ, mwĩrutei na mũkũyũ: Rĩrĩa honge ciaguo ciarĩkia gũthundũra na ciaruta mathangũ-rĩ, nĩmũmenyaga atĩ hĩndĩ ya riũa ĩrĩ hakuhĩ. <verse eid="MRK 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 13:29"/>Ũguo noguo, rĩrĩa mũkoona maũndũ macio magĩĩkĩka mũkaamenya ihinda rĩrĩ hakuhĩ, rĩrĩ o mũromo-inĩ. <verse eid="MRK 13:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 13:30"/>Ngũmwĩra atĩrĩ na ma, rũciaro rũrũ rũtigaathira nginya maũndũ macio mothe makaahingio. <verse eid="MRK 13:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 13:31"/>Igũrũ na thĩ nĩigathira, no ciugo ciakwa itigathira.<verse eid="MRK 13:31"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Gũtirĩ Mũndũ ũũĩ Mũthenya na Ithaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 13:32"/>“Gũtirĩ mũndũ o na ũrĩkũ ũũĩ ũhoro wa mũthenya ũcio kana ithaa rĩu, o na araika a igũrũ matiũĩ, o na Mũriũ ndooĩ, tiga Ithe wiki! <verse eid="MRK 13:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 13:33"/>Ikaragai mwĩiguĩte! Ikaragai mwĩhũgĩte! Mũtiũĩ rĩrĩa ihinda rĩu rĩgaakinya. <verse eid="MRK 13:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 13:34"/>Gũkahaana ta mũndũ ũgũthiĩ rũgendo ũrĩa atigaga egaĩra ndungata ciake irorage mũciĩ, o ndungata akamĩhe wĩra wayo, na agatiga atha mũikaria wa mũrango o nake aikarage ehũũgĩte.<verse eid="MRK 13:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 13:35"/>“Nĩ ũndũ ũcio, ikaragai mwĩiguĩte tondũ mũtiũĩ rĩrĩa mwene mũciĩ agacooka, kana agooka hwaĩ-inĩ, kana ũtukũ gatagatĩ, kana ngũkũ ĩkĩgamba, o na kana gũgĩthererũka. <verse eid="MRK 13:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 13:36"/>O rĩrĩa angĩũka-rĩ, mũtikanareke amũkore mwĩrigĩtwo. <verse eid="MRK 13:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 13:37"/>Ũguo ngũmwĩra, noguo ngwĩra andũ othe, atĩrĩ, ‘Ikaragai mwĩiguĩte’.”<verse eid="MRK 13:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MRK 14"/>
  <para style="s1">Jesũ Gũitĩrĩrio Maguta arĩ Bethania</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 14:1"/>Na rĩrĩ, gwatigaire o mĩthenya ĩĩrĩ nĩguo kũgĩe na Gĩathĩ kĩa Bathaka na kĩa Mĩgate ĩtarĩ Mĩĩkĩre Ndawa ya Kũimbia,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gĩathĩ kĩa Bathaka kĩaririkanagia Ayahudi ũrĩa mũraika wa Ngai aahĩtũkĩire mĩciĩ yao agĩthiĩ kũũraga marigithathi ma andũ a Misiri.</char></note> nao athĩnjĩri-Ngai arĩa anene na arutani a watho nĩmacaragia ũrĩa mangĩnyiitithia Jesũ na njĩra ya wara nĩguo mamũũrage. <verse eid="MRK 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 14:2"/>Makiuga atĩrĩ, “No tũtingĩmũnyiita hĩndĩ ya Gĩathĩ, tondũ andũ mahota kũruta haaro.”<verse eid="MRK 14:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 14:3"/>Na rĩrĩa arĩ itũũra-inĩ rĩa Bethania kwa mũndũ wetagwo Simoni ũrĩa warĩ na mangũ, aikarĩte metha-inĩ akĩrĩa irio-rĩ, nĩhookire mũndũ-wa-nja arĩ na cuba ya maguta ma goro mũno na manungi wega. Akĩũraga cuba ĩyo na akĩmũitĩrĩria maguta macio mũtwe.<verse eid="MRK 14:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 14:4"/>Andũ amwe arĩa maarĩ kuo makĩigua ũũru, makĩũrania atĩrĩ, “Maguta maya maitangwo ũguo nĩkĩ? <verse eid="MRK 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 14:5"/>Maguta macio nĩmangĩendio mbeeca ikĩrĩte mũcara wa mũndũ wa mwaka mũgima nacio mbeeca icio iheo athĩĩni.” Magĩkũũma mũndũ-wa-nja ũcio marĩ na ũũru.<verse eid="MRK 14:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 14:6"/>Nowe Jesũ akĩmeera atĩrĩ, “Tiganai nake, mũramũtanga nĩkĩ? Nĩanjĩka ũndũ mwega mũno. <verse eid="MRK 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 14:7"/>Athĩĩni marĩkoragwo na inyuĩ hĩndĩ ciothe na no mũmateithie hĩndĩ ĩrĩa yothe mũngĩenda. No niĩ mũtirĩkoragwo na niĩ hĩndĩ ciothe. <verse eid="MRK 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 14:8"/>Anjĩka o ũrĩa angĩahota. Aitĩrĩria mwĩrĩ wakwa maguta o mbere nĩ ũndũ wa kũhaarĩria gũthikwo gwakwa. <verse eid="MRK 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 14:9"/>Ngũmwĩra atĩrĩ na ma, kũrĩa guothe Ũhoro-ũyũ-Mwega ũkaahunjagio thĩinĩ wa thĩ, ũguo eka nĩũkeeragwo andũ nĩgeetha aririkanagwo.”<verse eid="MRK 14:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 14:10"/>Hĩndĩ ĩyo Judasi Mũisikariota, ũmwe wa arĩa ikũmi na eerĩ, agĩthiĩ kũrĩ athĩnjĩri-Ngai arĩa anene agakunyanĩre Jesũ kũrĩ o. <verse eid="MRK 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 14:11"/>Nao magĩkena mũno maigua ũguo na makĩmwĩra nĩmekũmũhe mbeeca. Nĩ ũndũ ũcio Judasi agĩcaria mweke wa kũmũneana kũrĩ o.<verse eid="MRK 14:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jesũ Kũrĩanĩra Gĩathĩ kĩa Bathaka na Arutwo Ake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 14:12"/>Mũthenya wa mbere wa Gĩathĩ kĩa Mĩgate ĩtarĩ Mĩĩkĩre Ndawa ya Kũimbia, o ũrĩa wathĩnjagwo gatũrũme ka Bathaka-rĩ, arutwo a Jesũ makĩmũũria atĩrĩ, “Ũkwenda tũthiĩ kũ tũkahaarĩrie nĩguo ũkarĩĩre irio cia Bathaka kuo?”<verse eid="MRK 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 14:13"/>Nĩ ũndũ ũcio agĩtũma arutwo ake eerĩ akĩmeera atĩrĩ, “Thiĩi mũtoonye itũũra, na nĩ mũgũcemania na mũndũ ũkuuĩte ndigithũ ya maaĩ. Mũrũmĩrĩrei. <verse eid="MRK 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 14:14"/>Kũrĩa egũtoonya mwĩre mwene nyũmba ĩyo atĩrĩ, ‘Mũrutani arooria atĩrĩ, nyũmba yakwa ya ageni ĩrĩ ha, harĩa ingĩrĩĩra irio cia Bathaka na arutwo akwa?’ <verse eid="MRK 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 14:15"/>Nake nĩekũmuonia nyũmba nene ya igũrũ ĩkĩrĩtwo indo na ĩgathondekwo wega. Haarĩriai irio cia Bathaka iitũ kuo.”<verse eid="MRK 14:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 14:16"/>Arutwo acio makiumagara, magĩtoonya itũũra, magĩkora maũndũ mahaana o ta ũrĩa Jesũ aamerĩte. Nĩ ũndũ ũcio makĩhaarĩria irio cia Bathaka.<verse eid="MRK 14:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 14:17"/>Na gwakinya hwaĩ-inĩ, Jesũ agĩkinya kuo marĩ na arutwo arĩa ikũmi na eerĩ. <verse eid="MRK 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 14:18"/>Maikarĩte metha-inĩ makĩrĩa akĩmeera atĩrĩ, “Ngũmwĩra atĩrĩ na ma, ũmwe wanyu nĩekũngunyanĩra, ũmwe wa arĩa mararĩĩanĩra na niĩ.”<verse eid="MRK 14:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 14:19"/>Makĩnyiitwo nĩ kĩeha mũno, na o ũmwe akamũũria atĩrĩ, “Ti-itherũ hihi nĩ niĩ?”<verse eid="MRK 14:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 14:20"/>Jesũ akĩmacookeria akĩmeera atĩrĩ, “Nĩ ũmwe wanyu inyuĩ ikũmi na eerĩ, ũrĩa ũgũtobokanĩria mũgate mbakũri-inĩ hamwe na niĩ. <verse eid="MRK 14:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 14:21"/>Mũrũ wa Mũndũ egũthiĩ o ta ũrĩa ũhoro wake wandĩkĩtwo. No mũndũ ũrĩa ũgaakunyanĩra Mũrũ wa Mũndũ kaĩ arĩ na haaro-ĩ! Nĩ kaba mũndũ ũcio atangĩaciarirwo.”<verse eid="MRK 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 14:22"/>Ningĩ o makĩrĩĩaga-rĩ, Jesũ akĩoya mũgate, agĩcookia ngaatho, agĩcooka akĩwenyũranga, akĩhe arutwo ake, akiuga atĩrĩ, “Oyai; ũyũ nĩguo mwĩrĩ wakwa.”<verse eid="MRK 14:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 14:23"/>Agĩcooka akĩoya gĩkombe, agĩcookia ngaatho akĩmanengera, nao othe magĩkĩnyuĩra.<verse eid="MRK 14:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 14:24"/>Akĩmeera atĩrĩ, “Ĩno nĩyo thakame yakwa ya kĩrĩkanĩro, ĩrĩa ĩitĩtwo nĩ ũndũ wa andũ aingĩ. <verse eid="MRK 14:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 14:25"/>Ngũmwĩra atĩrĩ na ma, ndikũnyua rĩngĩ ndibei ya maciaro ma mũthabibũ, nginya mũthenya ũrĩa ngaamĩnyua ĩrĩ njerũ ũthamaki-inĩ wa Ngai.”<verse eid="MRK 14:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 14:26"/>Na maarĩkia kũina rwĩmbo, makiumagara magĩthiĩ kĩrĩma-inĩ kĩa Mĩtamaiyũ.<verse eid="MRK 14:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jesũ Kwaria ũrĩa Petero Arĩmũkaana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 14:27"/>Nake Jesũ akĩmeera atĩrĩ, “Inyuĩ inyuothe nĩmũrĩndirika, nĩgũkorwo nĩ kwandĩkĩtwo atĩrĩ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 14:27">“ ‘Nĩngaringa mũrĩithi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 14:27">nacio ngʼondu ihurunjũke.’<verse eid="MRK 14:27"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 14:28"/>No ndaariũka, nĩngamũtongoria gũthiĩ Galili.”<verse eid="MRK 14:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 14:29"/>Petero akĩmwĩra atĩrĩ, “O na othe mangĩgũtirika, niĩ ndingĩgũtirika.”<verse eid="MRK 14:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 14:30"/>Nake Jesũ akĩmũcookeria, akĩmwĩra atĩrĩ, “Ngũkwĩra atĩrĩ na ma, ũmũthĩ, o ũtukũ ũyũ, ngũkũ ĩtanakũga keerĩ, nĩũrĩngaana maita matatũ.”<verse eid="MRK 14:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 14:31"/>No Petero akĩaria ahinyĩrĩirie, akiuga atĩrĩ, “O na angĩkorwo ndĩrĩkuanĩra nawe, niĩ ndingĩgũkaana!” O na acio angĩ othe makiuga o ũguo.<verse eid="MRK 14:31"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mũgũnda-inĩ wa Gethisemane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 14:32"/>Nao magĩkinya handũ heetagwo Gethisemane, nake Jesũ akĩĩra arutwo ake atĩrĩ, “Ikarai haha thiĩ ngahooe.” <verse eid="MRK 14:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 14:33"/>Akĩoya Petero na Jakubu na Johana agĩthiĩ nao, na o hĩndĩ ĩyo akĩnyiitwo nĩ kĩeha kĩnene na agĩthĩĩnĩka mũno. <verse eid="MRK 14:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 14:34"/>Akĩmeera atĩrĩ, “Ngoro yakwa nĩĩraigua kĩeha mũno o ta ingĩkua, ikarai haha na mwĩhũge.”<verse eid="MRK 14:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 14:35"/>Na aathiathia hanini, akĩĩgũithia thĩ, akĩhooya atĩ korwo kwahoteka, ihinda rĩu rĩmweherere. <verse eid="MRK 14:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 14:36"/>Akiuga atĩrĩ, “Abba, Baba, maũndũ mothe nĩmahotekaga nĩwe. Njehereria gĩkombe gĩkĩ. No ti ũrĩa ngwenda niĩ, no nĩ ũrĩa wee ũkwenda.”<verse eid="MRK 14:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 14:37"/>Ningĩ agĩcooka harĩ arutwo ake akĩmakora makomete. Akĩũria Petero atĩrĩ, “Simoni, kaĩ ũkomete? Ndũngĩhota gũikara ithaa rĩmwe wĩiguĩte? <verse eid="MRK 14:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 14:38"/>Mwĩhũgagei na mũhooyage nĩgeetha mũtikagwe magerio-inĩ. Ngoro nĩyenda, no mwĩrĩ ndũrĩ na hinya.”<verse eid="MRK 14:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 14:39"/>O rĩngĩ agĩthiĩ akĩhooya o ũguo. <verse eid="MRK 14:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 14:40"/>Na acooka rĩngĩ harĩo, agĩkora makomete tondũ nĩmahĩtĩtwo nĩ toro. Nao makĩrigwo nĩ ũrĩa mangĩmwĩra.<verse eid="MRK 14:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 14:41"/>Ningĩ agĩũka ihinda rĩa gatatũ akĩmooria atĩrĩ, “O na rĩu mũrĩ o toro, o mũhurũkĩte? Kinyiai hau! Ithaa nĩrĩakinya. Atĩrĩrĩ, Mũrũ wa Mũndũ nĩakunyanĩirwo akaneanwo moko-inĩ ma andũ ehia. <verse eid="MRK 14:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 14:42"/>Ũkĩrai, tũthiĩ! Ũrĩa ũkũngunyanĩra nĩarooka.”<verse eid="MRK 14:42"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jesũ Kũnyiitwo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 14:43"/>O akĩaragia-rĩ, Judasi, ũmwe wa arutwo arĩa ikũmi na eerĩ, agĩkinya. Ookire arĩ na gĩkundi kĩnene kĩa andũ marĩ na hiũ cia njora na njũgũma, matũmĩtwo nĩ athĩnjĩri-Ngai arĩa anene, na arutani a watho na athuuri.<verse eid="MRK 14:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 14:44"/>Judasi ũcio wamũkunyanĩire nĩamaheete kĩmenyithia akameera atĩrĩ, “Ũrĩa ndĩmumunya nĩwe; mũmũnyiite na mũmũtware arangĩirwo.” <verse eid="MRK 14:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 14:45"/>Judasi o rĩmwe agĩthiĩ harĩ Jesũ, akĩmwĩta atĩrĩ, “Rabii!” na akĩmũmumunya. <verse eid="MRK 14:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 14:46"/>Nao andũ acio makĩguthũkĩra Jesũ makĩmũnyiita. <verse eid="MRK 14:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 14:47"/>Na ũmwe wa arĩa maarũngiĩ hakuhĩ agĩcomora rũhiũ rwake rwa njora agĩtinia gũtũ kwa ndungata ya mũthĩnjĩri-Ngai ũrĩa mũnene.<verse eid="MRK 14:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 14:48"/>Nake Jesũ akĩmooria atĩrĩ, “Kaĩ ndĩ mũtongoria wa akararia a watho atĩ nĩkĩo muoka kũũnyiita mũrĩ na hiũ cia njora na njũgũma? <verse eid="MRK 14:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 14:49"/>Ndĩratũũraga na inyuĩ hekarũ-inĩ ngĩrutanaga mũthenya o mũthenya na mũtingĩĩnyiita. No rĩrĩ, Maandĩko no nginya mahiinge.” <verse eid="MRK 14:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 14:50"/>Hĩndĩ ĩyo arutwo ake othe makĩmũtiganĩria, makĩũra.<verse eid="MRK 14:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 14:51"/>Na mwanake ũmwe ũteehumbĩte kĩndũ tiga taama wa gatani akĩrũmĩrĩra Jesũ. Na rĩrĩa maamũnyiitire, <verse eid="MRK 14:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 14:52"/>agĩtiga taama wake nao, akĩũra e njaga.<verse eid="MRK 14:52"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jesũ Gũtwarwo Mbere ya Kĩama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 14:53"/>Nao andũ acio magĩtwara Jesũ kũrĩ mũthĩnjĩri-Ngai ũrĩa mũnene, nao athĩnjĩri-Ngai arĩa anene othe, na athuuri na arutani a watho makĩgomana hamwe. <verse eid="MRK 14:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 14:54"/>Petero akĩmũrũmĩrĩra arĩ haraaya o nginya agĩkinya nja ya mũciĩ wa mũthĩnjĩri-Ngai ũcio mũnene. Agĩikarania na thigari kũu agĩota mwaki.<verse eid="MRK 14:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 14:55"/>Na rĩrĩ, athĩnjĩri-Ngai arĩa anene, o na Kĩama kĩu gĩothe,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:55 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kĩama gĩa Sanihedirini gĩakoragwo na athĩnjĩri-Ngai arĩa anene, na athuuri, na arutani a watho wa Musa.</char></note> magĩcaria ũira wa kũũragithia Jesũ, no mationire. <verse eid="MRK 14:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 14:56"/>Na andũ aingĩ nĩmarutire ũira wa maheeni, no ũira wao ũkĩaga kũiguana.<verse eid="MRK 14:56"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MRK 14:57"/>Gũgĩcooka gũkĩrũgama andũ amwe, nao makĩruta ũira wa maheeni makiuga atĩrĩ, <verse eid="MRK 14:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MRK 14:58"/>“Nĩtwaiguire akiuga atĩrĩ, ‘Nĩngatharia hekarũ ĩno yakĩtwo nĩ andũ, na njake ĩngĩ ĩtakĩtwo nĩ mũndũ na ihinda rĩa mĩthenya ĩtatũ.’ ” <verse eid="MRK 14:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MRK 14:59"/>No o na moiga ũguo, ũira wao ũkĩaga kũiguana.<verse eid="MRK 14:59"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="MRK 14:60"/>Hĩndĩ ĩyo mũthĩnjĩri-Ngai ũrĩa mũnene akĩrũgama gatagatĩ kao, akĩũria Jesũ atĩrĩ, “Kaĩ wee ũtarĩ na ũndũ ũngĩcookia? Nĩ ũhoro ũrĩkũ ũyũ ũrathitangwo naguo?” <verse eid="MRK 14:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MRK 14:61"/>No Jesũ agĩkira ki, na ndacookie ũndũ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:61">O rĩngĩ mũthĩnjĩri-Ngai ũcio mũnene akĩmũũria atĩrĩ, “Wee nĩwe Kristũ, Mũrũ wa Ũrĩa Mũrathime?”<verse eid="MRK 14:61"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MRK 14:62"/>Nake Jesũ akĩmũcookeria atĩrĩ, “Ĩĩ nĩ niĩ. Na nĩmũkona Mũrũ wa Mũndũ aikarĩte guoko-inĩ kwa ũrĩo kwa Ũrĩa-ũrĩ-Hinya, na agĩũka arĩ igũrũ rĩa matu.”<verse eid="MRK 14:62"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="MRK 14:63"/>Mũthĩnjĩri-Ngai ũcio mũnene agĩtembũranga nguo ciake. Akĩũria atĩrĩ, “Tũgũkĩbatario nĩ aira angĩ a kĩ? <verse eid="MRK 14:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MRK 14:64"/>Nĩmweiguĩra akĩruma Ngai. Mũgwĩciiria atĩa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:64">Nao othe makĩmũtuĩra atĩ aagĩrĩirwo nĩ kũũragwo. <verse eid="MRK 14:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="MRK 14:65"/>Hĩndĩ ĩyo amwe makĩambĩrĩria kũmũtuĩra mata, na makĩmũhumbĩra ũthiũ, makĩmũringa na ngundi makĩmwĩraga atĩrĩ, “Ta kĩrathe ũhoro.” Nacio thigari ikĩmuoya, ikĩmũhũũra.<verse eid="MRK 14:65"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Petero Gũkaana Jesũ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MRK 14:66"/>Na hĩndĩ ĩyo Petero aikarĩte o hau nja-rĩ, ũmwe wa ndungata cia airĩtu cia mũthĩnjĩri-Ngai ũrĩa mũnene akĩgerera ho. <verse eid="MRK 14:66"/><verse number="67" style="v" sid="MRK 14:67"/>Rĩrĩa oonire Petero agĩota mwaki, akĩmũrora wega.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:67">“Akĩmwĩra atĩrĩ, ‘O nawe uuma hamwe na Jesũ ũcio wa Nazarethi’.”<verse eid="MRK 14:67"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="MRK 14:68"/>Nowe Petero agĩkaana ũhoro ũcio, akĩmwĩra atĩrĩ, “Ndiũĩ ũhoro ũcio, o na ndiramenya nĩ atĩa ũroiga,” na akiumagara agĩthiĩ itoonyero-inĩ.<verse eid="MRK 14:68"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MRK 14:69"/>Na rĩrĩa ndungata ĩyo ya mũirĩtu yamuonire ho, o rĩngĩ ĩkĩĩra arĩa maarũngiĩ ho atĩrĩ, “Mũndũ ũyũ nĩ ũmwe wao.” <verse eid="MRK 14:69"/><verse number="70" style="v" sid="MRK 14:70"/>No Petero agĩkaana ũhoro ũcio rĩngĩ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:70">Thuutha wa kahinda kanini, arĩa maarũgamĩte hakuhĩ makĩĩra Petero atĩrĩ, “Ti-itherũ ũrĩ ũmwe wao, nĩ ũndũ wĩ Mũgalili.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:70 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mwarĩrie wa andũ a kuuma Galili warĩ na ngũũrani na wa andũ a kuuma Judea.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 14:70"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="MRK 14:71"/>Nake akĩambĩrĩria kwĩhĩta akiugaga atĩrĩ, “Niĩ ndiũĩ mũndũ ũyũ mũraaria ũhoro wake.”<verse eid="MRK 14:71"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="MRK 14:72"/>O hĩndĩ ĩyo ngũkũ ĩgĩkũga hĩndĩ ya keerĩ. Nake Petero akĩririkana ũhoro ũrĩa Jesũ aamwĩrĩte atĩrĩ, “Ngũkũ ĩtanakũga keerĩ nĩũrĩngaana maita matatũ.” Nake akĩambĩrĩria kũrĩra.<verse eid="MRK 14:72"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MRK 15"/>
  <para style="s1">Jesũ Gũtwarwo Mbere ya Pilato</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 15:1"/>Na rĩrĩ, rũciinĩ tene, athĩnjĩri-Ngai arĩa anene na athuuri, na arutani a watho, na Kĩama gĩothe magĩtua ũrĩa megwĩka. Makĩoha Jesũ, makĩmũtwara, makĩmũneana kũrĩ Pilato.<verse eid="MRK 15:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 15:2"/>Nake Pilato akĩmũũria atĩrĩ, “Wee nĩwe Mũthamaki wa Ayahudi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:2">Nake Jesũ akĩmũcookeria atĩrĩ, “Ĩĩ, ũguo woiga nĩguo.”<verse eid="MRK 15:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 15:3"/>Nao athĩnjĩri-Ngai arĩa anene makĩmũthitangĩra maũndũ maingĩ. <verse eid="MRK 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 15:4"/>Nĩ ũndũ ũcio Pilato akĩmũũria o rĩngĩ atĩrĩ, “Kaĩ wee ũtarĩ na ũndũ ũgũcookia? Ta rora maũndũ marĩa mothe maragũthitangĩra.”<verse eid="MRK 15:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 15:5"/>No Jesũ ndaigana gũcookia ũndũ, nake Pilato akĩgega.<verse eid="MRK 15:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 15:6"/>Na rĩrĩ, kwarĩ mũtugo hĩndĩ ya Iruga rĩu rĩa Bathaka, Pilato nĩamohoragĩra mwohwo ũmwe, o ũrĩa andũ mangĩetirie. <verse eid="MRK 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 15:7"/>Na nĩ kwarĩ mũndũ ũmwe wetagwo Baraba woohetwo hamwe na arĩa maambĩrĩirie ngũĩ ya gũũkĩrĩra thirikari na makooraga andũ thĩinĩ wa mbũkĩrĩra ĩyo. <verse eid="MRK 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 15:8"/>Nakĩo kĩrĩndĩ kĩnene gĩgĩthiĩ harĩ Pilato, gĩkĩmũũria eeke o ũrĩa aamenyerete gwĩka.<verse eid="MRK 15:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 15:9"/>Pilato akĩmooria atĩrĩ, “Nĩ mũkwenda ndĩmuohorere mũthamaki wa Ayahudi?” <verse eid="MRK 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 15:10"/>Nĩgũkorwo nĩamenyaga atĩ athĩnjĩri-Ngai arĩa anene maaneanĩte Jesũ kũrĩ we nĩ ũndũ wa ũiru. <verse eid="MRK 15:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 15:11"/>No rĩrĩ, athĩnjĩri-Ngai arĩa anene makĩringĩrĩria kĩrĩndĩ kĩu kĩĩre Pilato ohore Baraba handũ ha Jesũ.<verse eid="MRK 15:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 15:12"/>Pilato akĩmooria atĩrĩ, “Mũgũkĩenda njĩke atĩa na mũndũ ũyũ mwĩtaga mũthamaki wa Ayahudi?”<verse eid="MRK 15:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 15:13"/>Nao makĩanĩrĩra, makiuga atĩrĩ, “Mwambe mũtĩ igũrũ!”<verse eid="MRK 15:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 15:14"/>Nake Pilato akĩmooria atĩrĩ, “Nĩkĩ? Nĩ ngero ĩrĩkũ agerete?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:14">No-o magĩkĩrĩrĩria kwanĩrĩra, makiugaga atĩrĩ, “Mwambe mũtĩ igũrũ!”<verse eid="MRK 15:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 15:15"/>Na tondũ nĩendaga gũkenia kĩrĩndĩ kĩu, Pilato akĩmohorera Baraba. Akĩhũũrithia Jesũ iboko, agĩcooka akĩmũneana akambwo mũtĩ igũrũ.<verse eid="MRK 15:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Thigari Kũnyũrũria Jesũ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 15:16"/>Nacio thigari igĩtwara Jesũ gĩikaro-inĩ kĩa barũthi (na nĩkĩo gĩetagwo Puratoria); igĩcookanĩrĩria mbũtũ yothe ya thigari. <verse eid="MRK 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 15:17"/>Ikĩmũhumba nguo ndaaya ya rangi wa ndathi, igĩcooka igĩtuma thũmbĩ ya mĩigua, ikĩmwĩkĩra mũtwe. <verse eid="MRK 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 15:18"/>Ikĩambĩrĩria kũmũnyũrũria, ikĩmwĩraga atĩrĩ, “Ũkĩrĩ mũhoro, wee mũthamaki wa Ayahudi?” <verse eid="MRK 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 15:19"/>Ikĩmũhũũra na rũthanju mũtwe maita maingĩ ikĩmũtuagĩra mata. Ikĩĩgũithia thĩ mbere yake, ikĩmũturagĩria ndu ta ikũmũhooya. <verse eid="MRK 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 15:20"/>Na ciarĩkia kũmũnyũrũria-rĩ, ikĩmũruta nguo ĩyo ndaaya ya rangi wa ndathi, ikĩmũhumba nguo ciake mwene. Igĩcooka ikĩmuumagaria ikamwambe mũtĩ igũrũ.<verse eid="MRK 15:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jesũ Kwambwo Mũtharaba-inĩ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 15:21"/>Na marĩ njĩra thigari ikĩnyiita mũndũ wahĩtũkaga akiuma mĩgũnda-inĩ, wetagwo Simoni wa kuuma Kurene, ithe wa Alekisandero na Rufusi, na ikĩmũkuuithia mũtharaba wa Jesũ na hinya. <verse eid="MRK 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 15:22"/>Igĩgĩkinyia Jesũ handũ harĩa heetagwo Gologotha (ũguo nĩ kuuga Handũ hahaana ta Ihĩndĩ rĩa Mũtwe). <verse eid="MRK 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 15:23"/>Ningĩ igĩcooka ikĩmũhe ndibei ĩtukanĩtio na manemane, nake Jesũ akĩrega kũmĩnyua. <verse eid="MRK 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 15:24"/>Igĩkĩmwamba mũtĩ igũrũ. Ikĩgayana nguo ciake, na ũndũ wa gũcicuukĩra mĩtĩ nĩguo imenye o ĩrĩa mũndũ egũkuua.<verse eid="MRK 15:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 15:25"/>Kwarĩ thaa ithatũ cia rũciinĩ rĩrĩa ciamwambire mũtĩ igũrũ. <verse eid="MRK 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 15:26"/>Ũndũ ũrĩa aathitangĩirwo wandĩkĩtwo atĩrĩ, “Ũyũ nĩwe MŨTHAMAKI WA AYAHUDI.” <verse eid="MRK 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 15:27"/>Ningĩ ikĩamba atunyani eerĩ hamwe nake, ũmwe mwena wake wa ũrĩo, nake ũcio ũngĩ mwena wake wa ũmotho. <verse eid="MRK 15:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 15:28"/>(Namo Maandĩko makĩhingio marĩa moigaga atĩrĩ, “Aataranĩirio na andũ arĩa aagarari watho.”) <verse eid="MRK 15:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 15:29"/>Andũ arĩa maahĩtũkagĩra hau nĩmamũrumaga makĩinagia mĩtwe yao, makoiga atĩrĩ, “Hĩ! Wee ũngĩratharirie hekarũ na ũmĩake na mĩthenya ĩtatũ-rĩ, <verse eid="MRK 15:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 15:30"/>harũrũka uume mũtharaba-inĩ ũcio, wĩhonokie!”<verse eid="MRK 15:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 15:31"/>O ũndũ ũmwe athĩnjĩri-Ngai arĩa anene, na arutani a watho nĩmamũnyũrũragia, makerana atĩrĩ, “Nĩarahonokagia arĩa angĩ, no ndangĩhota kwĩhonokia we mwene. <verse eid="MRK 15:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 15:32"/>Kristũ ũyũ, Mũthamaki wa Isiraeli-rĩ, ta nĩakĩharũrũke rĩu oime mũtharaba-inĩ, nĩguo tuone twĩtĩkie.” O nao arĩa maambanĩirio hamwe nake, makĩmũruma.<verse eid="MRK 15:32"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Gĩkuũ kĩa Jesũ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 15:33"/>Na rĩrĩ, thaa thita cia mũthenya ciakinya, bũrũri wothe ũkĩgĩa nduma nginya thaa kenda. <verse eid="MRK 15:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 15:34"/>Na thaa kenda Jesũ akĩgũthũka na mũgambo mũnene, akiuga atĩrĩ, “Eloi, Eloi, lama sabakithani?” naguo ũguo nĩ kuuga atĩrĩ, “Ngai wakwa, Ngai wakwa, wandiganĩria nĩkĩ?”<verse eid="MRK 15:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 15:35"/>Rĩrĩa andũ amwe a arĩa marũngiĩ hau maiguire ũguo, makiuga atĩrĩ, “Ta thikĩrĩriai agĩĩta Elija.”<verse eid="MRK 15:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 15:36"/>Mũndũ ũmwe agĩtengʼera, agĩtobokia thibũnji thiki-inĩ akĩmĩthecerera kamũrangi-inĩ akĩhe Jesũ anyue. Akiuga atĩrĩ, “Tiganai nake. Rekei tuone kana Elija nĩegũũka kũmũcuurũria mũtharaba-inĩ.”<verse eid="MRK 15:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 15:37"/>Nake Jesũ agĩkaya aanĩrĩire, agĩtuĩkana.<verse eid="MRK 15:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 15:38"/>Nakĩo gĩtambaya kĩa hekarũ gĩgĩatũkana icunjĩ igĩrĩ kuuma igũrũ nginya thĩ.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:38 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gĩtambaya kĩa hekarũ kĩagayanĩtie Handũ-harĩa-Hatheru na Handũ-harĩa-Hatheru-Mũno. Gwatũkana gwakĩo kuonanirie atĩ Kristũ nĩatoonyire kwa Ngai nĩ ũndũ witũ, na agĩtũhingũrĩra njĩra ya gũthiiaga mbere ya Ngai.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 15:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 15:39"/>Na rĩrĩa mũnene-wa-thigari-igana, ũrĩa warũngiĩ hau mangʼethanĩire, aiguire ũrĩa akaya na akĩona ũrĩa akua, akiuga atĩrĩ, “Ti-itherũ mũndũ ũyũ oima Mũrũ wa Ngai!” <verse eid="MRK 15:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 15:40"/>Nĩ haarĩ na atumia meeroragĩra marĩ haraaya. Ũmwe wao aarĩ Mariamu Mũmagidali, na Mariamu nyina wa Jakubu ũrĩa warĩ Mũnini na wa Jose, na Salome. <verse eid="MRK 15:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 15:41"/>Rĩrĩa aarĩ Galili, atumia aya nĩo maamũrũmagĩrĩra na makamũtungatagĩra. Ningĩ hau nĩ haarĩ na atumia angĩ aingĩ arĩa mookĩte nake Jerusalemu.<verse eid="MRK 15:41"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Gũthikwo kwa Jesũ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 15:42"/>Na tondũ kwarĩ Mũthenya wa Kwĩhaarĩria (nĩguo mũthenya ũrĩa wĩ mbere ya Thabatũ), gwakuhĩrĩria hwaĩ-inĩ-rĩ, <verse eid="MRK 15:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 15:43"/>Jusufu wa Arimathea, mũndũ warĩ igweta mũno Kĩama-inĩ gĩa athuuri, na we mwene nĩeetagĩrĩra ũthamaki wa Ngai, agĩthiĩ kũrĩ Pilato na ũcamba, akĩhooya etĩkĩrio akuue mwĩrĩ wa Jesũ.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:43 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Maarĩ na ihenya rĩa kweheria mwĩrĩ wa Jesũ mũtĩ-igũrũ maũthike mbere ya Thabatũ kwambĩrĩria.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 15:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 15:44"/>Nake Pilato akĩgega aigua atĩ Jesũ nĩarĩkĩtie gũkua. Agĩĩta mũthigari ũrĩa mũnene-wa-thigari-igana, akĩmũũria kana Jesũ nĩarĩkĩtie gũkua. <verse eid="MRK 15:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 15:45"/>Rĩrĩa aamenyithirio nĩ mũnene ũcio wa thigari igana atĩ nĩguo kwarĩ, agĩĩtĩkĩria Jusufu akuue mwĩrĩ ũcio. <verse eid="MRK 15:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 15:46"/>Nĩ ũndũ ũcio Jusufu akĩgũra taama wa gatani, agĩcuurũria mwĩrĩ ũcio. Akĩũkũnja na taama ũcio wa gatani, agĩthiĩ akĩũiga thĩinĩ wa mbĩrĩra yenjetwo rwaro-inĩ rwa ihiga. Agĩcooka akĩgaragaria ihiga rĩkĩhinga mũromo wa mbĩrĩra ĩyo. <verse eid="MRK 15:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 15:47"/>Nake Mariamu Mũmagidali na Mariamu ũrĩa nyina wa Jose makĩona harĩa aigirwo.<verse eid="MRK 15:47"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MRK 16"/>
  <para style="s1">Kũriũka kwa Jesũ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 16:1"/>Na rĩrĩ, Thabatũ yathira, Mariamu Mũmagidali, na Mariamu nyina wa Jakubu, na Salome makĩgũra indo nungi wega nĩgeetha mathiĩ makahake mwĩrĩ wa Jesũ. <verse eid="MRK 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 16:2"/>Mũthenya wa mbere wa kiumia, rũciinĩ tene thuutha wa riũa kũratha, marĩ njĩra magĩthiĩ mbĩrĩra-inĩ, <verse eid="MRK 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 16:3"/>nĩmoranagia atĩrĩ, “Nũũ ũgũtũgaragarĩria ihiga rĩehere mũromo-inĩ wa mbĩrĩra?”<verse eid="MRK 16:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 16:4"/>No rĩrĩa maatiirire maitho, makĩona ihiga rĩu nĩrĩagaragarĩtio rĩkehera, nĩgũkorwo rĩarĩ inene mũno. <verse eid="MRK 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 16:5"/>Na rĩrĩa maatoonyaga mbĩrĩra-thĩinĩ, makĩona mwanake wehumbĩte nguo njerũ ndaaya aikarĩte thĩ mwena wao wa ũrĩo, nao makĩmaka.<verse eid="MRK 16:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 16:6"/>Nake akĩmeera atĩrĩ, “Tigai kũmaka. Mũracaria Jesũ ũrĩa wa Nazarethi, ũrĩa ũrambirwo mũtĩ igũrũ. Nĩariũkĩte! Ndarĩ haha. Onei harĩa maramũigĩte. <verse eid="MRK 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 16:7"/>No thiĩi mwĩre arutwo ake o na Petero atĩrĩ, ‘Nĩekũmũtongoria gũthiĩ Galili. Kũu nĩkuo mũkaamuona, o ta ũrĩa aamwĩrire’.”<verse eid="MRK 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 16:8"/>Atumia acio makiuma hau mbĩrĩra-inĩ makĩinainaga na magegete. Matirĩ mũndũ meerire ũndũ, tondũ nĩmetigagĩra.<verse eid="MRK 16:8"/></para>
  <para style="s2">(Maandĩko mamwe ma tene matirĩ gacunjĩ gaka kuuma Mariko 16:9-20)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 16:9"/>Mũthenya wa mbere wa kiumia rũciinĩ tene Jesũ ariũka-rĩ, aambire kuumĩrĩra Mariamu Mũmagidali ũrĩa aarutĩte ndaimono mũgwanja. <verse eid="MRK 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 16:10"/>Nake Mariamu agĩthiĩ akĩĩra arĩa maatũire na Jesũ, akĩmakora magĩcakaya na makĩrĩra. <verse eid="MRK 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 16:11"/>Nao maigua atĩ Jesũ nĩariũkĩte, na atĩ Mariamu nĩamuonete, makĩrega gwĩtĩkia.<verse eid="MRK 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 16:12"/>Thuutha ũcio Jesũ akiumĩrĩra andũ angĩ eerĩ ao, ahaana ũndũ ũngĩ, rĩrĩa maathiiaga mĩgũnda-inĩ. <verse eid="MRK 16:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 16:13"/>Andũ acio makĩhũndũka, magĩthiĩ makĩĩra arutwo arĩa angĩ; no-o nao makĩrega kũmetĩkia.<verse eid="MRK 16:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 16:14"/>Thuutha ũcio Jesũ akiumĩrĩra arutwo arĩa ikũmi na ũmwe makĩrĩa irio; akĩmatetia nĩ ũndũ wa kwaga gwĩtĩkia na nĩ ũndũ wa ũmũ wa ngoro ciao, nĩ ũndũ wa kũrega gwĩtĩkia arĩa maamuonete thuutha wa kũriũka gwake.<verse eid="MRK 16:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 16:15"/>Akĩmeera atĩrĩ, “Thiĩi thĩ yothe mũkahunjĩrie andũ othe Ũhoro-ũrĩa-Mwega. <verse eid="MRK 16:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 16:16"/>Na mũndũ o wothe ũgetĩkia na abatithio nĩakahonoka, no ũrĩa wothe ũtagetĩkia nĩagatuĩrwo ciira. <verse eid="MRK 16:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 16:17"/>Nacio ciama ici nĩ igatwaranaga na arĩa metĩkĩtie: Nĩmakaingata ndaimono thĩinĩ wa rĩĩtwa rĩakwa; na nĩmakaaria na thiomi njerũ; <verse eid="MRK 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 16:18"/>na nĩmakanyiita nyoka na moko mao; na rĩrĩa makaanyua thumu, ndũkamathũkia o na hanini; nĩmakaigagĩrĩra andũ arĩa arũaru moko, nao mahone.”<verse eid="MRK 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 16:19"/>Mwathani Jesũ aarĩkia kũmaarĩria ũhoro ũcio, agĩtwarwo igũrũ na agĩikara thĩ guoko-inĩ kwa ũrĩo kwa Ngai. <verse eid="MRK 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 16:20"/>Nao arutwo magĩcooka makiumagara na makĩhunjia ũhoro kũndũ guothe, nake Mwathani akĩrutithania wĩra nao, na agekĩraga ũhoro wake hinya na ũndũ wa ciama iria ciatwaranaga na ũhoro ũcio.<verse eid="MRK 16:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 16"/>
</usx>
